  "errors": [],
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "17206138",
      "title": "The Next Steps",
      "lectureOrder": 601,
      "videoOrder": 527,
      "sourceHash": "464fda49c4260ec3b7392e50a8f56f9302b15fc59c4b17a804be6560d5dbc459",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.3,
          "end": 9.29,
          "en": "With all the core basics out of the way, let's dive into building more complex components or one more",
          "zh": "在所有核心基礎都講完之後，讓我們深入建構更複雜的元件，或者這個單元再一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 9.29,
          "end": 13.9,
          "en": "complex component in this module. We'll build a modal component,",
          "zh": "更複雜的元件。我們要建構一個 modal 元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 14,
          "end": 20.87,
          "en": "so like this pop-up, this overlay inside of a page with a nice backdrop behind it where we can",
          "zh": "就是像這樣的彈出視窗、頁面裡的這個覆蓋層，後面有漂亮的 backdrop，我們可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 20.87,
          "end": 25.31,
          "en": "pass our own content into it and which we can also configure,",
          "zh": "把自己的內容傳進去，也可以對它進行設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 25.37,
          "end": 29.63,
          "en": "for example where we can control from outside whether it's shown or not.",
          "zh": "例如我們可以從外部控制它要不要顯示。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 29.72,
          "end": 36.74,
          "en": "We'll also learn how we can dispatch our own events from inside our web component, so that we can react",
          "zh": "我們也會學到如何從 web component 內部派送自己的事件，這樣我們就能在它外部"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 36.74,
          "end": 42.59,
          "en": "to these custom events outside of it and we'll see a lot of the features you already learned about in",
          "zh": "對這些 custom event 做出反應，也會看到很多你在"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 42.59,
          "end": 44.68,
          "en": "the last modules in action too.",
          "zh": "前幾個單元已經學過的功能實際運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 44.72,
          "end": 49.2,
          "en": "So a great practice as well as many exciting new features,",
          "zh": "既是很棒的練習，也有許多令人興奮的新功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 49.25,
          "end": 50,
          "en": "let's dive in.",
          "zh": "讓我們開始吧。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "17206140",
      "title": "Creating the Basic Modal Component",
      "lectureOrder": 602,
      "videoOrder": 528,
      "sourceHash": "1cf68669718e9612d58dde1d8e38e0977d2b55e73c7ce4a763ea3d41c91e4cb2",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.33,
          "end": 5.39,
          "en": "So let's start building that modal component",
          "zh": "那我們就開始建構這個 modal 元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.39,
          "end": 13.28,
          "en": "and for that I have a brand new project, just an HTML file with that basic HTML5 skeleton, no script",
          "zh": "為此我有一個全新的專案，只有一個 HTML 檔，帶著基本的 HTML5 骨架，沒有 script"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 13.28,
          "end": 20.57,
          "en": "files, nothing. There, I will now add my modal.js file where I want to create that code for that modal",
          "zh": "檔，什麼都沒有。在那裡，我現在要新增 modal.js 檔，我想在裡面建立那個 modal"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 20.66,
          "end": 22.01,
          "en": "web component.",
          "zh": "web component 的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 22.07,
          "end": 27.41,
          "en": "Now throughout this module, always feel free to pause the video and try something on your own,",
          "zh": "在這個單元裡，隨時都可以暫停影片，自己試試看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 27.47,
          "end": 32.3,
          "en": "if we're working on a certain feature where you feel like hey I can do that on my own,",
          "zh": "如果我們正在做某個功能，而你覺得嘿，這個我自己做得出來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 32.3,
          "end": 35.01,
          "en": "definitely pause and try it on your own,",
          "zh": "一定要暫停，自己試試看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 35.15,
          "end": 41.18,
          "en": "otherwise just code along and you will see many of the things we covered in the last lectures and modules",
          "zh": "否則就跟著一起寫程式，你會看到很多我們在先前課程和單元涵蓋過的內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 41.54,
          "end": 48.74,
          "en": "and this module should therefore also help with really understanding all these pieces and see how they",
          "zh": "因此這個單元也應該能幫助你真正理解所有這些部分，並看看它們如何"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 48.74,
          "end": 50.02,
          "en": "come together.",
          "zh": "結合在一起。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 50.18,
          "end": 57.14,
          "en": "So in modal.js, I will start by creating a new component class with the class keyword and I will name",
          "zh": "所以在 modal.js 裡，我會先用 class 關鍵字建立一個新的元件類別，並將它命名為"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 57.14,
          "end": 65.21,
          "en": "it modal and I will extend the HTML element, so I'll not extend an existing HTML element like a div or",
          "zh": "modal，並且我會擴充 HTMLElement，所以我不會擴充像 div 這樣既有的 HTML 元素或"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 65.21,
          "end": 66.33,
          "en": "anything like that,",
          "zh": "之類的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 66.35,
          "end": 75.02,
          "en": "I'll start from scratch here. Now before I add any content here, any logic, I will also register this with",
          "zh": "我會在這裡從零開始。現在在我加入任何內容或邏輯之前，我也會用"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 75.02,
          "end": 84.13,
          "en": "custom elements define, I'll name it uc-modal, that will be my tag and I point at this modal class.",
          "zh": "customElements.define 註冊它，我會把它命名為 uc-modal，那會是我的標籤，並指向這個 modal 類別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 84.14,
          "end": 90.92,
          "en": "Now with that added, I'll go to the index.html file and there as before, add the script import",
          "zh": "現在加好之後，我會到 index.html 檔，像之前一樣在那裡加入 script"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 91.85,
          "end": 99.8,
          "en": "to the modal.js file and thereafter we can add it here, uc-modal adds our own HTML tag in the",
          "zh": "匯入 modal.js 檔，之後我們就可以在這裡加入它，uc-modal 會在"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 99.8,
          "end": 105.28999999999999,
          "en": "body of this template and later we'll also add some logic so that we have to click a button to show",
          "zh": "這個 template 的 body 裡加入我們自己的 HTML 標籤，稍後我們也會加入一些邏輯，讓我們必須點擊按鈕才能顯示"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 105.28999999999999,
          "end": 108.03999999999999,
          "en": "it and height it but that will all come later,",
          "zh": "和隱藏它，但那都是之後的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 108.05,
          "end": 114.68,
          "en": "for now let's start adding some content to this modal and I'll start with the constructor where we always",
          "zh": "現在先開始為這個 modal 加入一些內容，我會從 constructor 開始，我們總是"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 114.68,
          "end": 117.5,
          "en": "have to call super first and",
          "zh": "必須先呼叫 super，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 117.5,
          "end": 124.15,
          "en": "now in here, I will set up this general template for this modal and for that as you learned,",
          "zh": "現在在這裡，我會為這個 modal 設定這個通用 template，而為此，如你所學，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 124.28,
          "end": 126.29,
          "en": "we want to create a shadow DOM.",
          "zh": "我們要建立一個 shadow DOM。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 126.29,
          "end": 130.44,
          "en": "Now as you also learned, this is of course not a hard requirement,",
          "zh": "如你也學到的，這當然不是硬性要求，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 130.46,
          "end": 137.66,
          "en": "we can create custom elements without the shadow DOM but the shadow DOM gives us many advantages and",
          "zh": "我們可以建立沒有 shadow DOM 的 custom element，但 shadow DOM 給我們很多好處，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 137.66,
          "end": 140.14,
          "en": "therefore I definitely want to use it here.",
          "zh": "因此我在這裡一定要使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 140.39,
          "end": 147.47,
          "en": "So I will call this attach shadow and set the mode to open as always",
          "zh": "所以我會呼叫 this.attachShadow，並一如往常把 mode 設為 open，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 147.53,
          "end": 154.91,
          "en": "and now we can use the shadow root to start setting our innerHTML, so the template so to say, the",
          "zh": "現在我們可以用 shadow root 開始設定 innerHTML，也就是所謂的 template，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 154.9,
          "end": 160.68,
          "en": "HTML code of this custom component that is hidden away from the light DOM.",
          "zh": "這個 custom element 的 HTML 程式碼，它被隱藏在 light DOM 之外。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 160.73,
          "end": 167.53,
          "en": "Now I want to create a modal and this will actually consist of two major parts,",
          "zh": "現在我想建立一個 modal，它實際上會由兩個主要部分組成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 167.66,
          "end": 175.64,
          "en": "for one I will have a div with a CSS class of backdrop, could also be an ID of backdrop if you prefer",
          "zh": "第一，我會有個帶 CSS class 為 backdrop 的 div，如果你比較喜歡，也可以用 backdrop 這個 id"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 175.64,
          "end": 176.21,
          "en": "that",
          "zh": "那樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 176.38,
          "end": 183.11,
          "en": "and this will be the part behind the modal which will gray out the rest of the page whilst a modal is",
          "zh": "這會是 modal 後面那個部分，當 modal 在前景時，它會把頁面其餘部分變灰"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 183.11,
          "end": 191.14,
          "en": "in the foreground and the other part therefore is of course the modal itself and again here I'm using a",
          "zh": "因此另一個部分當然就是 modal 本身，同樣地，我在這裡使用的是"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 191.14,
          "end": 192.79,
          "en": "class of a modal,",
          "zh": "modal 這個 class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 192.79,
          "end": 199.03,
          "en": "actually let's use the ID because we can be that specific here and selecting an ID is actually a",
          "zh": "其實我們改用 id 吧，因為在這裡我們可以那麼精確，而且選取 id 實際上"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 199.03,
          "end": 201.49,
          "en": "bit faster than selecting a class,",
          "zh": "比選取 class 快一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 201.49,
          "end": 205.19,
          "en": "so from a CSS perspective, this is a bit better",
          "zh": "所以從 CSS 的角度來看，這稍微好一些"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 205.19,
          "end": 211.57,
          "en": "and now let me also add style tags here so that we can style all the components or all the elements",
          "zh": "現在讓我也在這裡加入 style 標籤，這樣我們就能設定所有元件或所有元素的樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 211.57,
          "end": 216.64,
          "en": "we'll have in the modal and I will start with some rough styling and with the rough layout and later",
          "zh": "我們會在 modal 裡用到，我會先從粗略的樣式和粗略的版面配置開始，稍後"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 216.64,
          "end": 221.39,
          "en": "we'll add more and more feature to that modal, like different slot areas and so on,",
          "zh": "我們會為那個 modal 加入越來越多的功能，例如不同的 slot 區域等等，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 221.47,
          "end": 224.39,
          "en": "something we haven't covered yet, we'll learn it in this module.",
          "zh": "這是我們還沒涵蓋的內容，我們會在這個單元學到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 224.88,
          "end": 227.48,
          "en": "So let's start building that modal",
          "zh": "那我們就開始建構這個 modal"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 227.54,
          "end": 232.81,
          "en": "and first of all here I'll select the backdrop and I'll set a style for that backdrop.",
          "zh": "首先在這裡，我會選取 backdrop，並為那個 backdrop 設定樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 232.81,
          "end": 240.67,
          "en": "Now the style for this backdrop will be that it has a position of fixed from the top of the page and",
          "zh": "這個 backdrop 的樣式會是 position 設為 fixed，從頁面頂部開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 241.12,
          "end": 244.89,
          "en": "the way this is positioned in the index.html file directly in the body,",
          "zh": "而它在 index.html 檔裡直接放在 body 中的定位方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 244.9,
          "end": 249.58,
          "en": "this will refer to the overall document, to the overall page as a container.",
          "zh": "這會以整份文件、整個頁面作為容器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 249.58,
          "end": 254,
          "en": "So from the top I want to have a distance of zero, from the left as well",
          "zh": "所以從頂部我想要距離為零，從左邊也是"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 254.26,
          "end": 257.64,
          "en": "and then this backdrop should cover the entire page.",
          "zh": "然後這個 backdrop 應該覆蓋整個頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 257.83,
          "end": 263.56,
          "en": "So I'll give it a width of 100% and for the height, this would not work unless we also",
          "zh": "所以我會給它 width 100%，至於高度，除非我們也把"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 263.56,
          "end": 267.81,
          "en": "set the height of our body and the HTML tag to 100%",
          "zh": "body 和 HTML 標籤的高度設為 100%，否則這樣行不通"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 267.91,
          "end": 275.56,
          "en": "but here we can use 100vh which stands for viewport height and also is about the entire height",
          "zh": "但在這裡我們可以用 100vh，它代表 viewport height，基本上也就是我們視窗的"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 275.62,
          "end": 278.52,
          "en": "of our window basically.",
          "zh": "整個高度。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 278.65,
          "end": 290.18,
          "en": "Now I'll give it a background of RGBA and then a transparent black color, maybe 75% opacity so 25%",
          "zh": "現在我會給它 RGBA 的背景，然後是透明的黑色，也許 75% 不透明度，所以是 25%"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 290.2,
          "end": 296.98,
          "en": "transparency here and with that, we should have a backdrop in place. Now since we already import",
          "zh": "的透明度，這樣我們應該就有 backdrop 了。現在既然我們已經匯入"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 297.19,
          "end": 298.33,
          "en": "this",
          "zh": "這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 298.81,
          "end": 301.12,
          "en": "and we use our tag here,",
          "zh": "並在這裡使用我們的標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 301.15,
          "end": 308.45,
          "en": "we should be able to reload this page and indeed, we now have a gray background and that is the modal",
          "zh": "我們應該可以重新載入這個頁面，確實如此，我們現在有灰色背景，那就是 modal"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 308.45,
          "end": 309.59,
          "en": "background,",
          "zh": "背景，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 309.59,
          "end": 315.04,
          "en": "it's not obvious here but we can confirm this if we simply inspect this in the developer tools,",
          "zh": "在這裡並不明顯，但如果我們直接在開發者工具裡檢查它，就能確認，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 315.11,
          "end": 317.07,
          "en": "it's this background, this div",
          "zh": "就是這個背景，這個 div"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 317.07,
          "end": 318.91,
          "en": "here that is responsible for that.",
          "zh": "在這裡造成這個效果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 318.92,
          "end": 321.02,
          "en": "If I uncheck the background, it's gone.",
          "zh": "如果我取消勾選 background，它就消失了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 321.05,
          "end": 323.16,
          "en": "So we see the modal background here,",
          "zh": "所以我們在這裡看到 modal 背景，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 323.18,
          "end": 324.38,
          "en": "that's great",
          "zh": "太好了"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 324.38,
          "end": 332.99,
          "en": "and if we had other content on this page and I will add something here, please confirm your choice and",
          "zh": "而如果這個頁面有其他內容，我會在這裡加些東西，「請確認你的選擇」，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 332.99,
          "end": 340.56,
          "en": "then we have a button which maybe says show details and confirm whatever you want,",
          "zh": "然後有個按鈕，也許寫著「顯示詳細資料」和「確認」，隨便你想要什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 341.40999999999997,
          "end": 344.45,
          "en": "if I now reload,",
          "zh": "如果我現在重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 344.59000000000003,
          "end": 348.68,
          "en": "this is hidden behind the modal or behind the backdrop.",
          "zh": "這會被隱藏在 modal 後面，或 backdrop 後面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 348.68,
          "end": 349.55,
          "en": "So that is working,",
          "zh": "所以那是有效的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 349.58,
          "end": 353.78,
          "en": "now just one tiny thing so that it's a little bit less ugly,",
          "zh": "現在只是一個小地方，讓它稍微不那麼醜，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 354.23,
          "end": 357.03,
          "en": "let me again set some general styles, here",
          "zh": "讓我再次設定一些通用樣式，在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 357.08,
          "end": 360.95,
          "en": "I'll set a box sizing of border box for all the elements and",
          "zh": "我會為所有元素設定 box-sizing 為 border-box，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 361.13,
          "end": 363.68,
          "en": "that includes my custom elements by the way",
          "zh": "順帶一提，這也包含我的 custom element"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 363.68,
          "end": 367.07,
          "en": "and for the body, I'll set a margin of zero",
          "zh": "而對於 body，我會把 margin 設為零"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 367.25,
          "end": 372.02,
          "en": "and I'll set a font family of sans-serif here because I simply prefer that",
          "zh": "我也會在這裡把 font-family 設為 sans-serif，因為我單純比較喜歡這樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 372.07,
          "end": 374.88,
          "en": "and now this looks a bit nicer.",
          "zh": "現在這樣看起來好一些了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 375.47,
          "end": 376.75,
          "en": "I'll get rid of the margin actually,",
          "zh": "其實我要把 margin 拿掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 376.79,
          "end": 382.52,
          "en": "let's give this a margin of 2rem instead so that we have a little bit of margin on the body,",
          "zh": "我們改給它 2rem 的 margin，這樣 body 就會有一點邊距，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 382.52,
          "end": 382.69,
          "en": "yes.",
          "zh": "是的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 383.14,
          "end": 383.36,
          "en": "Okay,",
          "zh": "好的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 383.36,
          "end": 386.25,
          "en": "so this is the general styling, the backdrop is in place.",
          "zh": "這就是通用樣式，backdrop 已經就位。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 386.33,
          "end": 390.98,
          "en": "Now let's also add the modal style itself in the next lecture.",
          "zh": "現在我們也在下一堂課加入 modal 本身的樣式。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "17206142",
      "title": "Adding the Modal Container",
      "lectureOrder": 603,
      "videoOrder": 529,
      "sourceHash": "68670c7c2efe33eef6f00d288c129b987acc688ad09dbb7fe358aa6978063bcf",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.45,
          "end": 8.33,
          "en": "So with the backdrop added, let's work on modal, so #modal selects the element with the ID",
          "zh": "加好 backdrop 之後，讓我們來處理 modal，所以 #modal 會選取 id 為"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.33,
          "end": 14.84,
          "en": "modal and just to reiterate on that, because we're in the shadow DOM, this only affects elements with",
          "zh": "modal 的元素，再重申一次，因為我們在 shadow DOM 裡，這只會影響"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 14.84,
          "end": 18.04,
          "en": "the ID modal that are inside of our template here,",
          "zh": "我們這個 template 裡 id 為 modal 的元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 18.05,
          "end": 19.35,
          "en": "so basically only",
          "zh": "所以基本上只有"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 19.97,
          "end": 27.41,
          "en": "this element here and for the modal, I want to have that in the foreground, so I'll actually give",
          "zh": "這裡這個元素。對於 modal，我想讓它在前景，所以我其實會給"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 27.41,
          "end": 31.92,
          "en": "my backdrop a z-index of let's say 10 and modal",
          "zh": "我的 backdrop 一個 z-index，比如說 10，而 modal"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 31.94,
          "end": 33.71,
          "en": "will have a z-index of 100",
          "zh": "會有 z-index 100"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 33.74,
          "end": 40.49,
          "en": "because it should have a higher z-index so that the backdrop is in the background of the modal.",
          "zh": "因為它應該有更高的 z-index，這樣 backdrop 才會在 modal 的後面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 40.49,
          "end": 48.03,
          "en": "I'll also give a position of fixed, to position it in a fixed way in our viewport in our document, from",
          "zh": "我也會給它 position 為 fixed，讓它在我們的 viewport、我們的文件中固定定位，從"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 48.03,
          "end": 48.45,
          "en": "the top",
          "zh": "頂部開始"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 48.45,
          "end": 52.92,
          "en": "let's say we have a distance of 15vh",
          "zh": "假設我們有 15vh 的距離"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 55.59,
          "end": 64.95,
          "en": "and from the left we have a distance of let's say 25% and then we have a width of 50%",
          "zh": "而從左邊我們有比如說 25% 的距離，然後寬度是 50%"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 64.98,
          "end": 70.68,
          "en": "because we have 25 distance from the left, then a width of 50% and then also 25% from the",
          "zh": "因為我們從左邊有 25 的距離，然後寬度 50%，接著從右邊也有 25%，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 70.68,
          "end": 73.02,
          "en": "right which is the leftover space,",
          "zh": "也就是剩下的空間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 73.02,
          "end": 78.62,
          "en": "therefore this should be nicely centered and you can set different styles, optimize this for mobile,",
          "zh": "因此這應該會漂亮地置中，而你可以設定不同的樣式、為行動裝置最佳化，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 78.62,
          "end": 84.12,
          "en": "I'm not caring so much about the styling here, I just want to focus on the general functionality and",
          "zh": "我在這裡不太在意樣式，我只想專注在一般功能上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 84.12,
          "end": 85.71000000000001,
          "en": "not write a ton of styles.",
          "zh": "而不寫一大堆樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 85.77,
          "end": 90.53999999999999,
          "en": "You could add media queries in here, whatever you need for the right styling.",
          "zh": "你可以在這裡加入 media query，任何你需要的正確樣式都可以。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 90.53999999999999,
          "end": 97.5,
          "en": "I'll go with this styling and I'll give it a background of white and to ensure that we can see something",
          "zh": "我就用這個樣式，並給它白色背景，為了確保我們能看到東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 97.5,
          "end": 97.82,
          "en": "for now,",
          "zh": "目前為止，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 97.83,
          "end": 104.16,
          "en": "I'll give it a height of let's say 30rem and we might be able to get rid of this later once we have",
          "zh": "我會給它比如說 30rem 的高度，等我們在裡面有"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 104.16,
          "end": 105.33,
          "en": "some content in there.",
          "zh": "一些內容後，之後也許就能移除這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 107.58,
          "end": 114.50999999999999,
          "en": "I also want to have a border radius of let's say 3 pixels and I'll give it a box shadow of 0, 2 pixels",
          "zh": "我也想要比如說 3 像素的 border-radius，並給它 0、2 像素、"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 114.57,
          "end": 115.78999999999999,
          "en": "8 pixels",
          "zh": "8 像素的 box-shadow"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 116.1,
          "end": 123.12,
          "en": "and then let's say this style here, some transparent box shadow drop shadow",
          "zh": "然後比如說這裡這個樣式，一些透明的 box-shadow 陰影"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 123.12,
          "end": 128.61,
          "en": "and with all of that in place, let's head over and reload this page and here's our modal",
          "zh": "這些都就位後，讓我們切過去重新載入這個頁面，這就是我們的 modal"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 128.61,
          "end": 132.71,
          "en": "and obviously, this is missing all the content but we're getting there.",
          "zh": "顯然它還缺了所有內容，但我們慢慢上軌道了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 132.84,
          "end": 134.28,
          "en": "Now we have the modal container,",
          "zh": "現在我們有了 modal 容器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 134.28,
          "end": 136.26,
          "en": "we have the backdrop behind it,",
          "zh": "我們有了它後面的 backdrop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 136.26,
          "end": 141,
          "en": "now we want to populate that modal with some content of course",
          "zh": "現在我們當然想用一些內容來填充那個 modal"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 141,
          "end": 146.57999999999998,
          "en": "and I want to have some static content in there and I also want to have some slotted content in there.",
          "zh": "我想在裡面放一些靜態內容，也想在裡面放一些透過 slot 傳入的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 146.61,
          "end": 147.81,
          "en": "So let's add that next.",
          "zh": "那我們接下來就加入這些。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "17206144",
      "title": "Styling the Modal Elements",
      "lectureOrder": 604,
      "videoOrder": 530,
      "sourceHash": "46d8cfa3d3d0e6745b5491a4349fb4e3aa7f4ec2b834165fc94b20cc202b0c7e",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 7.32,
          "en": "Let's add some content in the modal, so inside of my modal div there,",
          "zh": "讓我們在 modal 裡加入一些內容，所以在我那個 modal div 裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.5,
          "end": 10.23,
          "en": "I actually want to have three sections.",
          "zh": "我其實想要有三個 section。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.47,
          "end": 13.83,
          "en": "I want to have a header in there which holds a title",
          "zh": "我想在裡面有個 header 來放標題"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.04,
          "end": 19.35,
          "en": "and for now I'll simply have a dummy title there, h1 tag please confirm.",
          "zh": "目前我會先簡單放個假的標題，h1 標籤寫著「請確認」。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 22.16,
          "end": 24.48,
          "en": "Below the header here,",
          "zh": "在 header 下面這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 24.53,
          "end": 27.35,
          "en": "I want to have a section,",
          "zh": "我想要有一個 section，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 31.79,
          "end": 37.76,
          "en": "maybe with the ID main, whatever you want and in there, I'll have a slot because I want to be able to",
          "zh": "也許 id 為 main，隨便你想要什麼，而在裡面我會有一個 slot，因為我想要能夠"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 37.76,
          "end": 42.96,
          "en": "pass the content that is displayed as a message into this modal from outside",
          "zh": "從外部把顯示為訊息的內容傳進這個 modal"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 43.01,
          "end": 46.46,
          "en": "and actually you're of course not limited to passing in some text here,",
          "zh": "而其實你在這裡當然不限於傳入一些文字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 46.46,
          "end": 53.14,
          "en": "you can pass in anything here - you can pass in an image, buttons, a form, inputs, whatever you want.",
          "zh": "你可以在這裡傳入任何東西——你可以傳入圖片、按鈕、表單、input，任何你想要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 53.15,
          "end": 59.75,
          "en": "So I reserve a slot here and then below that slot, I'll have another section and this should",
          "zh": "所以我在這裡保留一個 slot，然後在那個 slot 下面，我會有另一個 section，這應該"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 59.75,
          "end": 66.04,
          "en": "be the section where I have my button or my two buttons, I want to have two buttons in here,",
          "zh": "是我放按鈕或兩個按鈕的 section，我想在這裡有兩個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 66.23,
          "end": 74.09,
          "en": "I'll give the section an ID of actions and the first button will be cancel, the second button will",
          "zh": "我會給這個 section id 為 actions，第一個按鈕會是 cancel，第二個按鈕會是"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 74.09,
          "end": 77.41,
          "en": "be confirm or okay or whatever you want",
          "zh": "confirm 或 okay，或任何你想要的"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 77.42,
          "end": 81.03999999999999,
          "en": "and of course you could also create this in a more generic way,",
          "zh": "當然你也可以用更通用的方式來建立這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 81.08,
          "end": 83.49,
          "en": "we have to draw a border at some point here,",
          "zh": "我們在這裡某個時候得劃一條邊框，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 83.53999999999999,
          "end": 85.95,
          "en": "so I will go for the hardcoded buttons here,",
          "zh": "所以我在這裡會採用寫死的按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 85.97,
          "end": 90.41,
          "en": "you could definitely find a solution where this can be passed in through slots too",
          "zh": "你絕對可以找到也能透過 slot 傳入的解法"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 90.74,
          "end": 97.43,
          "en": "and I will show you how to have different slot parts in your template here in a second, we'll see that",
          "zh": "而我等一下會示範如何在你的 template 裡有不同的 slot 部分，我們會"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 97.43,
          "end": 99.50999999999999,
          "en": "later in this module.",
          "zh": "在這個單元稍後看到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 99.53,
          "end": 101.97,
          "en": "So now I have these buttons in here,",
          "zh": "現在我在這裡有了這些按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 102.05,
          "end": 104,
          "en": "now we can style that a little bit.",
          "zh": "現在我們可以稍微設定一下樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 104.63,
          "end": 111.68,
          "en": "I'll select actions with the ID selector, give this a border to the top of one pixel solid and a light",
          "zh": "我會用 id 選擇器選取 actions，給它頂部 1 像素實線的邊框，顏色用淺"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 111.71000000000001,
          "end": 116.41,
          "en": "gray look let's say and if I now reload this,",
          "zh": "灰色，比如說，如果我現在重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 116.6,
          "end": 118.08,
          "en": "this is how it looks like,",
          "zh": "它看起來就是這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 118.4,
          "end": 120.5,
          "en": "I definitely want have a different layout here.",
          "zh": "我在這裡一定要有不同的版面配置。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 120.5,
          "end": 124.43,
          "en": "I want to distribute all these pieces across the available space,",
          "zh": "我想把所有這些部分分配到可用的空間裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 124.43,
          "end": 130.28,
          "en": "so for the entire modal here, I'll actually set the display to flex using flex box",
          "zh": "所以對這裡整個 modal，我其實會用 flexbox 把 display 設為 flex"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 130.28,
          "end": 134.12,
          "en": "and if that's something you don't know, attached to this video you'll find some helpful resources for",
          "zh": "如果這是你不知道的東西，這部影片的附件裡會有一些有幫助的資源"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 134.12,
          "end": 135.67,
          "en": "learning flex box,",
          "zh": "讓你學習 flexbox，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 135.68,
          "end": 143.99,
          "en": "it's a way of managing the layout in CSS or managing boxes, elements in CSS and distributing them.",
          "zh": "它是一種在 CSS 裡管理版面配置，或管理盒子、元素並分配它們的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 144.07999999999998,
          "end": 154.76,
          "en": "I'll set the flex direction to column here and I said justify content to space between here and this should",
          "zh": "我會在這裡把 flex-direction 設為 column，並把 justify-content 設為 space-between，這應該"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 154.76,
          "end": 161.57,
          "en": "ensure that if I now reload this all, the buttons are at the end here and now I just want to go to my",
          "zh": "確保如果我現在重新載入，全部按鈕都會在最後面，現在我只想進到我的"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 161.75,
          "end": 170.88,
          "en": "actions, give this a padding of let's say 1rem and also select my actions button elements here and give",
          "zh": "actions，給它比如說 1rem 的 padding，也選取我這裡 actions 裡的 button 元素，並給"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 170.88,
          "end": 178.45,
          "en": "them a margin left and right of 1rem and with that, we have our buttons in here.",
          "zh": "它們左右各 1rem 的 margin，這樣我們在這裡就有按鈕了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 178.52,
          "end": 185.79,
          "en": "Actually I want to have that differently, I want to give them 0.25rem to left and right margin",
          "zh": "其實我想要不一樣，我想給它們左右各 0.25rem 的 margin"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 186.21,
          "end": 194.45,
          "en": "and in my actions here, I'll set display to flex too and I'll set justify content here",
          "zh": "而在我這裡的 actions，我也會把 display 設為 flex，並在這裡把 justify-content 設為"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 194.63,
          "end": 200.63,
          "en": "to flex end. So now I have my buttons here at the bottom",
          "zh": "flex-end。所以現在我的按鈕在底部這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 200.63,
          "end": 205.57999999999998,
          "en": "and now of course you could style these buttons differently, for example make the cancel button red or",
          "zh": "現在你當然可以給這些按鈕不同的樣式，例如把 cancel 按鈕做成紅色或"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 205.57999999999998,
          "end": 208.46,
          "en": "yellow-ish and make the OK button green,",
          "zh": "偏黃色，並把 OK 按鈕做成綠色，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 208.46,
          "end": 213.91,
          "en": "I will keep them as they are because I don't want to lose too much time on all that styling.",
          "zh": "我會維持它們現在的樣子，因為我不想在那些樣式上花太多時間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 214.05,
          "end": 221.71,
          "en": "Let me quickly style that title up there though, so the header, I'll add the header selector here and there,",
          "zh": "不過讓我快速設定上面那個標題的樣式，也就是 header，我會在這裡加入 header 選擇器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 221.71,
          "end": 228.97,
          "en": "I'll set up padding of 1rem, just as I have it here for the actions and I'll then also add a header",
          "zh": "我會設定 1rem 的 padding，就像我在 actions 這裡設的一樣，然後我也會加入"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 229.06,
          "end": 231.42000000000002,
          "en": "h1 selector to select that h1 tag",
          "zh": "header h1 選擇器來選取"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 231.43,
          "end": 237.85,
          "en": "we have in the header and set the font size to 1.25rem maybe,",
          "zh": "我們在 header 裡的 h1 標籤，並把 font-size 設為也許 1.25rem，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 237.89,
          "end": 238.44,
          "en": "let's see,",
          "zh": "我們看看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 238.78,
          "end": 238.96,
          "en": "yes",
          "zh": "是的"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 240.62,
          "end": 243.72,
          "en": "and now we can pass in any content we want.",
          "zh": "現在我們可以傳入任何想要的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 243.89,
          "end": 246.37,
          "en": "Now I will also get rid of that height",
          "zh": "現在我也要把那個 height"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 246.38,
          "end": 247.48,
          "en": "I set up there,",
          "zh": "我在那裡設定的移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 247.58,
          "end": 254.06,
          "en": "that was only set temporarily to have some height when we had no content but now it should be as high",
          "zh": "那只是暫時設定，在我們沒有內容時有一些高度，但現在它的高度應該"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 254.06,
          "end": 260.63,
          "en": "as the content we pass in requires this to be and we can pass in any content we want. Since I have a",
          "zh": "取決於我們傳入的內容需要多高，而我們可以傳入任何想要的內容。既然我有"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 260.63,
          "end": 267.17,
          "en": "slot, we can go between the opening and closing tags of our modal and for example, add a paragraph and",
          "zh": "一個 slot，我們可以在 modal 的開始和結束標籤之間，例如加入一個段落，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 267.17,
          "end": 275.18,
          "en": "then add any message we would want to show here with your confirmation, you agree to pay the full amount,",
          "zh": "然後加入任何我們想顯示的訊息，「確認後，你同意支付全額款項」，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 275.36,
          "end": 280.76,
          "en": "whatever your app might be showing here and now with this paragraph added between the opening and closing",
          "zh": "不管你的應用程式在這裡顯示什麼，現在把這個段落加在 modal 的開始和"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 280.76,
          "end": 282.3,
          "en": "tag of our modal,",
          "zh": "結束標籤之間後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 282.32,
          "end": 287.21,
          "en": "if I reload the page, we see it here and now again, time for some styling.",
          "zh": "如果我重新載入頁面，我們就會在這裡看到它，現在又是設定樣式的時候了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 287.45,
          "end": 289.17,
          "en": "Let's go back to the modal,",
          "zh": "讓我們回到 modal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 289.19,
          "end": 296.15,
          "en": "keep in mind that the slot is inside of the main section so I'll style this main section here, select it",
          "zh": "記住 slot 在 main section 裡面，所以我會設定這個 main section 的樣式，用"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 296.15,
          "end": 300.88,
          "en": "by the ID selector main and give it a padding of 1rem too",
          "zh": "id 選擇器 main 選取它，也給它 1rem 的 padding"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 300.92,
          "end": 306.35,
          "en": "and if you would want to style the paragraph itself, you can use the techniques you learned in the last",
          "zh": "而如果你想設定段落本身的樣式，你可以使用你在先前課程學到的技巧，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 306.35,
          "end": 309.95,
          "en": "lectures with the slotted pseudo selector for example.",
          "zh": "例如 ::slotted 虛擬選擇器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 309.98,
          "end": 310.33,
          "en": "Here",
          "zh": "在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 310.34,
          "end": 316.96,
          "en": "I got no need to do that, so I will leave it as it is here.",
          "zh": "我沒有必要那麼做，所以我會讓它保持現在的樣子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 317.02,
          "end": 320.33,
          "en": "With that, we got a nice looking modal in my opinion,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，我認為我們就有了一個好看的 modal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 320.47,
          "end": 325.93,
          "en": "let's now ensure that we can also open and close it and we want to open it when this show details",
          "zh": "現在讓我們確保也能開啟和關閉它，而我們想要在這個 show details"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 325.93,
          "end": 328.23,
          "en": "and confirm button here is pressed.",
          "zh": "和 confirm 按鈕被按下時開啟它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 328.42,
          "end": 329.98,
          "en": "So that will be our next task",
          "zh": "那會是我們下一個任務"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 330.01,
          "end": 333.52,
          "en": "and if you have an idea for that, definitely try it on your own first.",
          "zh": "而如果你有想法，一定要先自己試試看。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "17206146",
      "title": "Adding Some General App Logic",
      "lectureOrder": 605,
      "videoOrder": 531,
      "sourceHash": "8e4e419b5e90eb36130bfcfc139a3f4db15be7611e5310656ad0524544271c96",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.36,
          "end": 8.84,
          "en": "So we want to be able to show that modal and for that, we need a way to control the visibility of the backdrop",
          "zh": "所以我們想要能夠顯示那個 modal，為此我們需要一種方式來控制 backdrop"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.93,
          "end": 10.01,
          "en": "and the modal.",
          "zh": "和 modal 的可見性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.01,
          "end": 12.8,
          "en": "Now there are various ways of doing so",
          "zh": "現在有各種做法"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.87,
          "end": 15.98,
          "en": "in CSS - we can set the opacity,",
          "zh": "在 CSS 裡——我們可以設定 opacity，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.98,
          "end": 18.39,
          "en": "we can set the display property,",
          "zh": "我們可以設定 display 屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.41,
          "end": 20.33,
          "en": "anything like that.",
          "zh": "任何類似的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.33,
          "end": 25.76,
          "en": "What we will need in the end is some way to pass in the information whether this should be visible",
          "zh": "我們最終需要的是一種方式，來傳入這個是否應該可見的資訊"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.76,
          "end": 27.5,
          "en": "or not from outside,",
          "zh": "、以及是否應該從外部傳入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.5,
          "end": 34.81,
          "en": "so from our main document because one possible way would be to set let's say an open attribute, either",
          "zh": "也就是從我們的主要文件，因為一種可能的方式是設定比如說 open 屬性，可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.81,
          "end": 41.84,
          "en": "set this to true or as you also see it on some built-in elements, just open, for example the built-in",
          "zh": "把它設為 true，或者像你在一些內建元素上看到的，就只是 open，例如內建的"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 41.84,
          "end": 50,
          "en": "button element has a disabled attribute which you also add just like this. So when open or opened maybe",
          "zh": "button 元素有 disabled 屬性，你也是這樣加的。所以當 open 或也許 opened"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 50.27,
          "end": 55.3,
          "en": "is added let's say, then we want to show the modal, if it's not added we don't want to show it",
          "zh": "被加入時，比如說，我們就顯示 modal，如果沒被加入，我們就不顯示它"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 55.46,
          "end": 61.55,
          "en": "and now I'll add a script tag here and you could outsource this into a different file too of course where",
          "zh": "現在我會在這裡加入一個 script 標籤，你當然也可以把這放到不同的檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 61.55,
          "end": 66.44,
          "en": "I want to do something when this button is clicked and I want to add this opened attribute when we click",
          "zh": "我想在這個按鈕被點擊時做些事，並想在我們點擊它時加入這個 opened"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 66.44,
          "end": 67.52,
          "en": "it.",
          "zh": "屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 67.52,
          "end": 75.11,
          "en": "So I will now get access to my confirm button here maybe by using document query selector and I",
          "zh": "所以我現在會取得這裡 confirm 按鈕的存取權，也許用 document.querySelector，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 75.11,
          "end": 81.98,
          "en": "can select a button here because another advantage of the shadow DOM, we will just fetch this button",
          "zh": "我可以在這裡選取 button，因為 shadow DOM 的另一個優點是，我們只會抓到這個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 82.34,
          "end": 89.36,
          "en": "because the buttons in our modal are part of the shadow DOM and therefore we are in no danger of accidentally",
          "zh": "因為我們 modal 裡的按鈕屬於 shadow DOM，因此我們不會有不小心"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 89.36,
          "end": 91.65,
          "en": "selecting these from outside.",
          "zh": "從外部選到它們的風險。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 91.67,
          "end": 94.02000000000001,
          "en": "So that's another advantage of the shadow DOM here,",
          "zh": "所以這是 shadow DOM 在這裡的另一個優點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 94.1,
          "end": 99.47,
          "en": "when we select something in our main document, we only select buttons in that main document",
          "zh": "當我們在主要文件裡選取東西時，我們只會選到那個主要文件裡的按鈕"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 99.56,
          "end": 105.22999999999999,
          "en": "and in this case we only have one button, so I can use this query selector and then I'll add my event",
          "zh": "而在這個例子裡我們只有一個按鈕，所以我可以用這個 querySelector，然後我加上我的 event"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 105.22999999999999,
          "end": 116.82,
          "en": "listener here for the click event and here, I want to add the opened attribute to my uc-modal element.",
          "zh": "listener 來處理 click 事件，而在這裡我想把 opened 屬性加到我的 uc-modal 元素上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 117.78,
          "end": 125.64,
          "en": "For this, I'll get access to my modal with document query selector and now we can simply use uc-modal",
          "zh": "為此我會用 document.querySelector 取得我的 modal，現在我們可以直接用 uc-modal"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 125.67,
          "end": 132.63,
          "en": "as a selector because this is a valid tag by which we can select it and then we could say modal set",
          "zh": "作為選擇器，因為這是可以用來選取它的有效標籤，然後我們可以寫 modal.set"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 132.72,
          "end": 141.34,
          "en": "attribute opened and now we need to assign a value here and I'll set this to an empty string. Now in",
          "zh": "Attribute('opened')，現在我們需要在這裡指定一個值，我會把它設為空字串。現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 141.34,
          "end": 147.61,
          "en": "order to be able to see that effect, we have to make sure that we're not showing the modal by default,",
          "zh": "為了能看到那個效果，我們必須確保預設不會顯示 modal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 147.77,
          "end": 154.45,
          "en": "which we currently are and especially its backdrop is blocking us from clicking anything, so to hide",
          "zh": "而我們目前就是這樣，尤其是它的 backdrop 擋住我們點擊任何東西，所以要預設"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 154.45,
          "end": 163.81,
          "en": "it by default, we got a couple of possible ways of solving this; one way of making sure we can show and",
          "zh": "隱藏它，我們有幾種可能的解法；一種確保我們能顯示和"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 163.81,
          "end": 172.2,
          "en": "hide this is to set the opacity to 0 by default which will hide this but then we'll face a problem actually",
          "zh": "隱藏它的方式是把 opacity 預設設為 0，這會把它隱藏，但其實我們接著會遇到問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 172.41,
          "end": 178.14,
          "en": "because now if I reload this, it is hidden but we still can't click this because even though it's invisible,",
          "zh": "因為現在如果我重新載入，它被隱藏了，但我們仍然不能點擊，因為即使它看不見，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 178.17000000000002,
          "end": 186.33,
          "en": "it's fully opaque, it's still in front of us. Now we could change the z-index but we can also set the",
          "zh": "它完全不通透，仍然在我們前面。我們可以改 z-index，但也可以把"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 186.33,
          "end": 192.21,
          "en": "pointer events here to none and this will not accept any clicks on the backdrop but let them through",
          "zh": "這裡的 pointer-events 設為 none，這樣就不會接受任何在 backdrop 上的點擊，而是讓它們穿過去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 192.21,
          "end": 197.2,
          "en": "instead and we do the same on the modal and we just have to change this later when we show it",
          "zh": "我們在 modal 上也做同樣的事，只是在稍後顯示它時要改回來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 197.31,
          "end": 201.74,
          "en": "so that we then really block clicks through it but here we want to allow them.",
          "zh": "這樣到時候就真的會擋住穿過它的點擊，但在這裡我們想允許它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 201.75,
          "end": 207.89,
          "en": "So now if I reload, I can click this and if you watched, you saw opened was added here on the right,",
          "zh": "所以現在如果我重新載入，我可以點這個，如果你有注意看，你會看到 opened 被加在右邊這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 207.93,
          "end": 214.17000000000002,
          "en": "let me show this again. If I reload, this modal here doesn't have the opened attribute but if I click this",
          "zh": "讓我再示範一次。如果我重新載入，這裡的 modal 沒有 opened 屬性，但如果我點擊這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 214.17000000000002,
          "end": 218.79,
          "en": "button, watch it here on the right, here it is, there it opened.",
          "zh": "按鈕，注意看右邊這裡，就是這樣，它加上了 opened。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 218.79,
          "end": 224.57999999999998,
          "en": "So this is working and now in the next lecture, we can work on doing something in our component",
          "zh": "所以這是有效的，現在在下一堂課，我們可以來處理在我們的元件裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 224.57999999999998,
          "end": 226.86,
          "en": "when this opened attribute is added.",
          "zh": "當這個 opened 屬性被加入時做些事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "17206148",
      "title": "Opening the Modal via CSS",
      "lectureOrder": 606,
      "videoOrder": 532,
      "sourceHash": "074df773465ecd0f80d38dcd988962537e00af62d5832a5fbb735a3011c1567b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 9.72,
          "en": "To act when we add this opened attribute, we need to listen to changes in attributes obviously and you",
          "zh": "要在我們加入這個 opened 屬性時做出反應，我們顯然需要監聽屬性的變化，而你"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 9.72,
          "end": 11.76,
          "en": "learned how that works right.",
          "zh": "學過那怎麼運作對吧。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 11.76,
          "end": 14.43,
          "en": "Thus far we have all the logic in the constructor,",
          "zh": "到目前為止，我們把所有邏輯都放在 constructor 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.43,
          "end": 23.25,
          "en": "now it's simply time to add more methods here and I will add the attribute changed callback here and",
          "zh": "現在就該在這裡加入更多方法，我會在這裡加入 attributeChangedCallback，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 23.25,
          "end": 28.95,
          "en": "you remember that you here get the name of the attribute which changed, the old value and the new value",
          "zh": "你記得在這裡會取得變更的屬性名稱、舊值和新值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 29.31,
          "end": 33.33,
          "en": "and then this will trigger for any observed attribute which changed.",
          "zh": "然後任何已觀察且變更的屬性都會觸發它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 33.33,
          "end": 41.16,
          "en": "For this we also have to add our static getter here, observed attributes, and make sure you get the",
          "zh": "為此我們也必須在這裡加入我們的 static getter，observedAttributes，並確保你這裡的"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 41.16,
          "end": 42.15,
          "en": "naming right here",
          "zh": "命名正確"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 42.18,
          "end": 43.91,
          "en": "otherwise it will not work",
          "zh": "否則它不會運作"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 44.28,
          "end": 50.04,
          "en": "and there you have to return square brackets and then the name of the attributes you want to watch",
          "zh": "而在那裡你必須回傳方括號，然後是你想監看的屬性名稱"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 50.04,
          "end": 51.97,
          "en": "and here it's the opened attribute",
          "zh": "而這裡是 opened 屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 52.08,
          "end": 57.63,
          "en": "and if you chose a different name, that will be added here outside of your component,",
          "zh": "而如果你選了不同的名稱，也就是在元件外部這裡加入的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 57.63,
          "end": 61.38,
          "en": "then you also have to listen to a different name in here of course.",
          "zh": "那你當然也得在這裡監聽不同的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 61.38,
          "end": 65.37,
          "en": "Now for the addition of the opened attribute, this should be triggered",
          "zh": "現在對於加入 opened 屬性，這應該會被觸發"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 65.37,
          "end": 69.53,
          "en": "and then when this runs, maybe we also have other attributes,",
          "zh": "而當它執行時，也許我們還有其他屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 69.53999999999999,
          "end": 76.61,
          "en": "so here I will check if name is equal to opened and if that is the case, we know that something happened",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我會檢查 name 是否等於 opened，如果是的話，我們就知道"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 76.61,
          "end": 77.97,
          "en": "on the opened attribute",
          "zh": "opened 屬性上發生了變化"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 78.08,
          "end": 86.75,
          "en": "so we probably want to show our modal but I can simply add another if check and see if this has an attribute",
          "zh": "所以我們大概想顯示 modal，但我可以再加一個 if 檢查，看看 this 是否有"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 86.81,
          "end": 87.41,
          "en": "of opened",
          "zh": "opened 屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 87.44,
          "end": 94.16,
          "en": "now because if that is now available, then we know it has been added and then I know I want to change the",
          "zh": "因為如果它現在存在，我們就知道它被加入了，然後我知道我想改變"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 94.16,
          "end": 99.88,
          "en": "styling to set the opacity to 1 and to set pointer events to all,",
          "zh": "樣式，把 opacity 設為 1，並把 pointer-events 設為 all，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 99.89,
          "end": 103.65,
          "en": "so to react to clicks on my backdrop and my modal again",
          "zh": "這樣就能再次對 backdrop 和 modal 上的點擊做出反應"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 104.81,
          "end": 106.9,
          "en": "and there are a couple of ways of doing that.",
          "zh": "而有幾種做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 106.93,
          "end": 119.36,
          "en": "One thing we can do is we can access our shadow root and there of course, query for our backdrop and",
          "zh": "我們可以做的一件事是存取我們的 shadow root，當然在那裡查詢我們的 backdrop，並"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 119.36,
          "end": 121.72,
          "en": "set the style of the backdrop",
          "zh": "設定 backdrop 的樣式"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 121.73,
          "end": 129.86,
          "en": "and here, simply add opacity or set opacity to 1 and then also the style of the backdrop pointer events",
          "zh": "而在這裡，只要加入 opacity 或把 opacity 設為 1，然後也把 backdrop 樣式的 pointer-events"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 130.49,
          "end": 135.83,
          "en": "should be set to all, to react to all clicks on the backdrop",
          "zh": "設為 all，以對 backdrop 上的所有點擊做出反應"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 135.83,
          "end": 138.24,
          "en": "and then we do exactly the same here",
          "zh": "然後我們在這裡做完全相同的事"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 139.4,
          "end": 141.35,
          "en": "for our modal.",
          "zh": "對我們的 modal。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 141.41,
          "end": 146.84,
          "en": "So there we also set the opacity to 1 and the pointer events to all",
          "zh": "所以在那裡我們也把 opacity 設為 1、pointer-events 設為 all"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 146.97,
          "end": 151.89,
          "en": "and if you save that and you reload that page and you click that button,",
          "zh": "而如果你儲存後重新載入那個頁面，並點擊那個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 151.92000000000002,
          "end": 157.71,
          "en": "indeed both shows up here and now we can't click this button here anymore because the pointer events",
          "zh": "確實兩者都會顯示在這裡，而現在我們不能再點這個按鈕了，因為 pointer-events"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 157.8,
          "end": 158.67000000000002,
          "en": "are on,",
          "zh": "已經開啟，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 158.67000000000002,
          "end": 162.6,
          "en": "we now catch any clicks with the backdrop and with the modal.",
          "zh": "我們現在會用 backdrop 和 modal 捕捉任何點擊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 162.6,
          "end": 164.72,
          "en": "This is one possible way of doing this,",
          "zh": "這是一種可能的做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 164.73,
          "end": 169.98,
          "en": "there are other possible ways too but I will actually comment this out.",
          "zh": "也有其他可能的做法，但我其實會把這個註解掉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 169.98,
          "end": 176.97,
          "en": "It might seem like the obvious way of reacting to the opened attribute but if all you want to do is",
          "zh": "這看起來可能是對 opened 屬性做出反應的明顯做法，但如果你只想"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 176.97,
          "end": 185.11,
          "en": "change some styling, then there is a way easier approach to do that, to get there.",
          "zh": "改變一些樣式，那有個簡單得多的做法可以達到目的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 185.19,
          "end": 190.28,
          "en": "You don't need attribute changed callback for that, you don't need to listen to these changes",
          "zh": "你不需要為此使用 attributeChangedCallback，甚至不需要監聽這些"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 190.29,
          "end": 193.38,
          "en": "even, so I will comment all of that out,",
          "zh": "變化，所以我會把那些全部註解掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 193.41,
          "end": 198.18,
          "en": "it's nice knowing that and you would need that if you had any other logic you wanted to execute, like",
          "zh": "知道這些很好，而如果你有任何其他想執行的邏輯就會需要它，例如"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 198.27,
          "end": 204.6,
          "en": "start a timer, change some text, add an element but if you just want to change some styles, you can do",
          "zh": "啟動計時器、改變一些文字、加入元素，但如果你只想改變一些樣式，你可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 204.6,
          "end": 213.09,
          "en": "that with CSS only because what happens when the opened attribute is added to our tag here?",
          "zh": "只用 CSS 做到，因為當 opened 屬性被加到我們這裡的標籤時會發生什麼事？"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 213.18,
          "end": 215.72,
          "en": "Well then it looks like this here right,",
          "zh": "嗯，那它就會像這裡這樣，對吧，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 215.73,
          "end": 223.47,
          "en": "our tag and then the opened attribute and you might remember that in CSS, there are attributes selectors.",
          "zh": "我們的標籤然後是 opened 屬性，而你可能記得在 CSS 裡有屬性選擇器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 223.77,
          "end": 230.57999999999998,
          "en": "So we can simply write a CSS rule that changes the style when the opened attribute is available",
          "zh": "所以我們可以直接寫一條 CSS 規則，當 opened 屬性存在於"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 230.7,
          "end": 234.42000000000002,
          "en": "on our root element, on our host element.",
          "zh": "我們的根元素、我們的 host 元素上時改變樣式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 234.45,
          "end": 243.89,
          "en": "So what I'll do is I'll add a new rule here, :host, with the condition that the opened attribute is",
          "zh": "所以我要做的是在這裡加入一條新規則 :host，條件是 opened 屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 243.89,
          "end": 250.16,
          "en": "there and this is all I need to write for this, this now means for the host element, which is our custom tag,",
          "zh": "存在，這就是我為此需要寫的全部，這現在表示對 host 元素，也就是我們的 custom element 標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 250.58,
          "end": 257.21,
          "en": "when the opened attribute is available and this is the normal attribute syntax you know from CSS, then",
          "zh": "當 opened 屬性存在時，而這是你在 CSS 裡知道的正常屬性語法，然後"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 257.21,
          "end": 262.73,
          "en": "I want to change the style and I want to change the style of my backdrop, so I can still combine these",
          "zh": "我想改變樣式，我想改變我 backdrop 的樣式，所以我仍然可以組合這些"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 262.73,
          "end": 265.82,
          "en": "selectors and this just means select the backdrop",
          "zh": "選擇器，而這就表示選取 backdrop"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 265.97,
          "end": 272.65999999999997,
          "en": "if my host has the opened attribute and then I want to set the opacity to 1 and I want to set pointer",
          "zh": "如果我的 host 有 opened 屬性，然後我想把 opacity 設為 1，並把 pointer-"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 272.65999999999997,
          "end": 273.95,
          "en": "events to all",
          "zh": "events 設為 all"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 276.77,
          "end": 287.75,
          "en": "and I can now of course do the same for my modal by simply repeating this with #modal. And with",
          "zh": "而我現在當然也能對我的 modal 做同樣的事，只要用 #modal 重複一次。而有了"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 287.75,
          "end": 294.05,
          "en": "this change in place, please keep in mind that I commented out my attributes changed callback, so with this",
          "zh": "這項變更，請記住我已經把 attributeChangedCallback 註解掉了，所以有了"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 294.05,
          "end": 301.01,
          "en": "change in place up here, we can go back and reload our page and still click that button and see the modal",
          "zh": "上面這項變更，我們可以回去重新載入頁面，仍然點擊那個按鈕並看到 modal"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 301.01,
          "end": 305.28,
          "en": "and the backdrop and this is now the more elegant way of solving this",
          "zh": "和 backdrop，而這現在是解決這個問題更優雅的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 305.33,
          "end": 312.23,
          "en": "if you only need to change styles. If you needed to do anything else, like add an HTML element, then",
          "zh": "如果你只需要改變樣式。如果你需要做其他任何事，例如加入 HTML 元素，那"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 312.23,
          "end": 318.62,
          "en": "of course you would need to listen to that and then run whichever logic, add whichever element you want",
          "zh": "你當然就需要監聽它，然後執行任何邏輯、加入任何你想"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 318.62,
          "end": 321.11,
          "en": "to add in your attributes changed callback.",
          "zh": "在 attributeChangedCallback 裡加入的元素。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "17206150",
      "title": "Public Methods & Properties",
      "lectureOrder": 607,
      "videoOrder": 533,
      "sourceHash": "35a7fca01ea4816514401cba0df75929b81d455de507d51546ee271a56940685",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.19,
          "end": 5.7,
          "en": "The implementation we're currently using is absolutely fine,",
          "zh": "我們目前使用的實作完全沒問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.7,
          "end": 11.96,
          "en": "it opens the modal but we could also add another way of using our modal.",
          "zh": "它會開啟 modal，但我們也可以為 modal 加上另一種使用方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 12.12,
          "end": 18.66,
          "en": "We get access to it here in code, in our Javascript code and it's always important to remember that what",
          "zh": "我們在程式碼裡、在 JavaScript 程式碼裡取得它，而永遠要記得"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 18.66,
          "end": 27.63,
          "en": "you get here is a full Javascript object, the Javascript object representing this DOM node and this object",
          "zh": "你在這裡拿到的是完整的 JavaScript 物件，代表這個 DOM 節點的 JavaScript 物件，而這個物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 27.84,
          "end": 30.31,
          "en": "can be used to set the attribute,",
          "zh": "可以用來設定屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 30.33,
          "end": 32.48,
          "en": "we could also set the classes there,",
          "zh": "我們也可以在那裡設定 class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 32.55,
          "end": 40.29,
          "en": "we could even remove it from the DOM and since it is an object, it is an object based on our class here.",
          "zh": "我們甚至可以把它從 DOM 移除，而既然它是物件，它就是根據我們這裡的類別所建立的物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 40.29,
          "end": 44.18,
          "en": "This is in the end the object that was generated for us by the browser,",
          "zh": "這最終就是瀏覽器為我們產生的物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 44.25,
          "end": 50.55,
          "en": "it has all the default properties of HTML element which we extend here and it has its default",
          "zh": "它有我們在這裡擴充的 HTMLElement 的所有預設屬性，也有它的預設"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 50.58,
          "end": 57.96,
          "en": "methods and actually set attribute is just a default method of every HTML element",
          "zh": "方法，而其實 setAttribute 只是每個 HTML 元素都有的預設方法"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 58.14,
          "end": 64.85,
          "en": "and since we extend HTML element here, our own modal object also has set attribute available",
          "zh": "而既然我們在這裡擴充 HTMLElement，我們自己的 modal 物件也有 setAttribute 可用"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 65.19,
          "end": 72.03,
          "en": "but this means that if we add any new properties or methods in our class, we can also access these from",
          "zh": "但這表示如果我們在類別裡加入任何新屬性或多方法，我們也能從"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 72.03,
          "end": 78.92,
          "en": "outside and therefore one thing we could add here is an open method.",
          "zh": "外部存取它們，因此我們在這裡可以加入的一樣東西就是 open 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 78.94,
          "end": 83.81,
          "en": "Now please note that I did not add an underscore at the beginning here because I don't want to mark",
          "zh": "現在請注意，我在這裡開頭沒有加底線，因為我不想把它標記為"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 83.81,
          "end": 85.21000000000001,
          "en": "this as private,",
          "zh": "私有，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 85.21000000000001,
          "end": 92.68,
          "en": "it should indeed be accessible from outside and what I do in here is here, I add some code to show my",
          "zh": "它確實應該能從外部存取，而我在這裡做的就是加入一些程式碼來顯示我的"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 92.68,
          "end": 93.35,
          "en": "modal",
          "zh": "modal"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 93.49000000000001,
          "end": 98.62,
          "en": "and again this could be the code we use here before or I set my attribute",
          "zh": "同樣地，這可以是我們之前在這裡用的程式碼，或者我在這裡面"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 102.47999999999999,
          "end": 109.85,
          "en": "inside here.",
          "zh": "設定我的屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 109.88,
          "end": 115.64,
          "en": "Now what this allows me to do with this open method added is that I go back to my index.html file",
          "zh": "現在加入這個 open 方法後，它讓我能夠做的是回到我的 index.html 檔，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 116.24000000000001,
          "end": 122.96,
          "en": "and instead of setting the attribute here, which I absolutely can do, I can call open here on my modal",
          "zh": "然後不在這裡設定屬性（我完全可以那麼做），而是可以在我的 modal 物件上"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 122.96,
          "end": 125.91,
          "en": "object because I just added this open method",
          "zh": "呼叫 open，因為我剛加入了這個 open 方法"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 126.47,
          "end": 129.05,
          "en": "and if you're wondering why I would do it like this,",
          "zh": "而如果你想知道我為什麼要這樣做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 129.11,
          "end": 137.18,
          "en": "well I can abstract complexity away from my main document, from me as a component user and manage it",
          "zh": "嗯，我可以把複雜度從我的主要文件、從身為元件使用者的我身上抽象掉，並把它管理在"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 137.21,
          "end": 138.95,
          "en": "inside of my component.",
          "zh": "我的元件內部。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 138.95,
          "end": 144.77,
          "en": "Now obviously, the complexity is not very large here but if we were adding different elements or anything",
          "zh": "當然，這裡的複雜度不大，但如果我們要加入不同的元素或任何"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 144.77,
          "end": 151.91,
          "en": "like that, then all we have to do outside is call open and we do all the magic inside of this open method,",
          "zh": "類似的東西，那我們在外面只要呼叫 open，所有魔法都在這個 open 方法裡、"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 152.09,
          "end": 153.9,
          "en": "inside of our component.",
          "zh": "在我們的元件內部完成。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 153.92000000000002,
          "end": 159.74,
          "en": "So this is not a strictly better approach than setting the attribute manually as we did before outside",
          "zh": "所以這並不是比我們之前在元件外部手動設定屬性"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 159.74,
          "end": 160.91,
          "en": "of the component,",
          "zh": "嚴格更好的做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 160.94,
          "end": 165.06,
          "en": "it's just an alternative, an alternative of which you should be aware",
          "zh": "它只是另一種選擇，一種你應該知道的選擇"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 165.2,
          "end": 168.41,
          "en": "and actually it's perfectly fine to handle both cases,",
          "zh": "而其實同時處理兩種情況完全沒問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 168.41,
          "end": 176.03,
          "en": "the case that we add opened manually from outside or that we call open and you do find built-in elements",
          "zh": "一種是我們從外部手動加入 opened，另一種是我們呼叫 open，而你的確會找到內建元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 176.3,
          "end": 183.74,
          "en": "where you can call a method to something or where you can call a method from outside to do something.",
          "zh": "讓你可以對它呼叫方法，或讓你從外部呼叫方法來做某些事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 183.74,
          "end": 191.84,
          "en": "Now with this adjusted, I can reload my page and still open a modal because it has still the same mechanism,",
          "zh": "現在調整好之後，我可以重新載入頁面並仍然開啟 modal，因為它的機制還是一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 191.87,
          "end": 197.38,
          "en": "still the opened attribute gets added but now we're not doing this manually with our own code,",
          "zh": "opened 屬性仍然會被加入，但現在我們不是用自己的程式碼手動做這件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 197.51,
          "end": 200.45,
          "en": "we're calling open outside instead",
          "zh": "而是在外面呼叫 open"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 200.57,
          "end": 202.91,
          "en": "and this is just one alternative",
          "zh": "而這只是一種替代做法"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 202.91,
          "end": 204.72,
          "en": "I wanted to show you here.",
          "zh": "我想在這裡示範給你看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 204.86,
          "end": 208.55,
          "en": "Also be aware that you can not just call methods from outside,",
          "zh": "也要知道，你不只能從外部呼叫方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 208.76,
          "end": 218.94,
          "en": "if you had some public properties, so any other properties like let's say this is open and you set this",
          "zh": "如果你有一些公開屬性，也就是其他任何屬性，比如說 this.isOpen，而你一開始把它"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 218.94,
          "end": 223.2,
          "en": "to false initially and we change this to true here,",
          "zh": "設為 false，然後我們在這裡把它改成 true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 227.03,
          "end": 229.39,
          "en": "then you can access this from outside too.",
          "zh": "那你也能從外部存取它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 229.4,
          "end": 237.56,
          "en": "So now we have is open here and now after calling modal open, if I console log modal is open here from",
          "zh": "所以現在我們有了 isOpen，而在呼叫 modal.open 之後，如果我從元件外部"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 237.62,
          "end": 244.49,
          "en": "outside my component, you will see that if I open the console and I reload and I click this button, we",
          "zh": "console.log 這個 modal.isOpen，你會看到如果我打開 console、重新載入並點擊這個按鈕，我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 244.49,
          "end": 251.87,
          "en": "see false here because I should set it to true in open and not leave it as false,",
          "zh": "在這裡看到 false，因為我應該在 open 裡把它設為 true，而不是留成 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 251.94,
          "end": 252.39,
          "en": "so",
          "zh": "所以"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 252.4,
          "end": 253.54,
          "en": "let's give this another try,",
          "zh": "讓我們再試一次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 254.82,
          "end": 255.7,
          "en": "reload,",
          "zh": "重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 255.72,
          "end": 256.86,
          "en": "now we see true here.",
          "zh": "現在我們在這裡看到 true。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 256.86,
          "end": 262.67,
          "en": "So we can also access properties from outside our component and we might have some useful information in",
          "zh": "所以我們也能從元件外部存取屬性，而我們可能在裡面有一些有用的資訊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 262.68,
          "end": 268.89,
          "en": "there which we now can extract and use programmatically from our main document, from our main application",
          "zh": "我們現在可以從主要文件、從主要應用程式邏輯中以程式化方式取出並使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 268.89,
          "end": 274.45,
          "en": "logic which would be this one and which we still manage inside of our modal.",
          "zh": "也就是這裡這個部分，而它仍然由我們在 modal 內部管理。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 274.65,
          "end": 279.21,
          "en": "Now a little side note, if we do expose this is open formation,",
          "zh": "現在一點小補充，如果我們確實公開了這個 isOpen 資訊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 279.21,
          "end": 286.05,
          "en": "then we all of a sudden need to readd our attribute changed callback, not change the styles here but",
          "zh": "那我們突然就需要重新加回 attributeChangedCallback，不是在這裡改變樣式，但"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 286.05,
          "end": 287.4,
          "en": "certainly change",
          "zh": "一定要在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 287.4,
          "end": 299.05,
          "en": "this is open to true here and on the other hand, if we don't have that opened attribute, we want to change",
          "zh": "把 isOpen 改成 true，而另一方面，如果我們沒有那個 opened 屬性，我們想把"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 299.11,
          "end": 301.07,
          "en": "is open to false here.",
          "zh": "isOpen 改成 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 301.12,
          "end": 304.37,
          "en": "By the way we can get rid of that outer check,",
          "zh": "順帶一提，我們可以把那個外層檢查移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 304.57,
          "end": 307.25,
          "en": "we can always check for the existence of this attribute,",
          "zh": "我們永遠可以檢查這個屬性是否存在，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 307.54,
          "end": 313.75,
          "en": "even if this attribute change callback was triggered due to the change in some totally different attribute.",
          "zh": "即使這個 attributeChangedCallback 是因為某個完全不同的屬性變更而被觸發。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 313.75,
          "end": 319.14,
          "en": "So now, this is totally optional, just to show you that you can access properties from outside too",
          "zh": "所以現在，這完全是選用的，只是示範給你看你也能從外部存取屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 319.36,
          "end": 326.02,
          "en": "but now we have this extra functionality added, where we can always access this information too through",
          "zh": "但現在我們加入了這項額外功能，讓我們也永遠能透過"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 326.08,
          "end": 328.3,
          "en": "this public property.",
          "zh": "這個公開屬性存取這項資訊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 328.3,
          "end": 335.81,
          "en": "Now with this is open property exposed, we can actually enhance our logic out here and we can check that",
          "zh": "現在公開了這個 isOpen 屬性後，我們其實可以強化外面的邏輯，我們可以檢查"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 335.81,
          "end": 342.61,
          "en": "if this button gets clicked, we only want to open a modal if modal is open is not true,",
          "zh": "如果這個按鈕被點擊，我們只想在 modal.isOpen 不是 true 時開啟 modal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 342.62,
          "end": 346.15999999999997,
          "en": "so if this is not true hence an exclamation mark at the beginning,",
          "zh": "所以如果它不是 true，因此在開頭加上驚嘆號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 346.15999999999997,
          "end": 351.01,
          "en": "otherwise we don't have to call open because it already seems to be open.",
          "zh": "否則我們就不需要呼叫 open，因為它似乎已經開啟了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 351.02,
          "end": 355.90999999999997,
          "en": "Not sure how we could click this but if we did something fishy, then we would block this.",
          "zh": "不確定我們怎麼能點到這個，但如果我們做了什麼奇怪的事，我們就會擋住它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 355.90999999999997,
          "end": 359.3,
          "en": "So here I can show console log opening",
          "zh": "所以在這裡我可以顯示 console.log('opening')"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 362.88,
          "end": 364.89,
          "en": "and now if I reload, we see opening here",
          "zh": "而現在如果我重新載入，我們在這裡看到 opening"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 365.13,
          "end": 370.95,
          "en": "but now if I hack this and I manually remove the backdrop, now I all of a sudden can click this button",
          "zh": "但現在如果我手動改一下、把 backdrop 移除，我現在突然又能點這個按鈕"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 370.95,
          "end": 371.7,
          "en": "again",
          "zh": "了"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 371.7,
          "end": 377.54,
          "en": "but now you will see if I do so, we don't see opening again because of this extra check.",
          "zh": "但現在你會看到，如果我這麼做，我們不會再看到 opening，因為這個額外的檢查。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 377.55,
          "end": 383.94,
          "en": "So now we have this extra check which is a little bit useful here but it's easy to imagine other components",
          "zh": "所以現在我們有這個額外檢查，在這裡有點用處，但很容易想像其他元件"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 384.12,
          "end": 390.03,
          "en": "where you would need to get some information from inside to prevent strange logic from running outside,",
          "zh": "會需要從內部取得一些資訊，以防止奇怪的邏輯在外面、"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 390.09,
          "end": 395.4,
          "en": "so in your main application and then public properties like is open can be very helpful.",
          "zh": "也就是在你的主要應用程式裡執行，這時像 isOpen 這樣的公開屬性就非常有用。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "17206152",
      "title": "Understanding Named Slots",
      "lectureOrder": 608,
      "videoOrder": 534,
      "sourceHash": "c7f323aa98365c2b90ea4dc9cbb13fe75360a7ebfb6c96090eeef8d8c4bd26f9",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.36,
          "end": 10.52,
          "en": "So now that we got this open button working here, we got our basic, our very basic modal functionality",
          "zh": "現在我們已經讓這個開啟按鈕可以運作，也就有了基本的、非常基本的 modal 功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 10.52,
          "end": 11.75,
          "en": "in place.",
          "zh": "而且已經就定位了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 11.96,
          "end": 20.05,
          "en": "Now a next step that would be great is if we could customize the content of this modal a bit more.",
          "zh": "接下來很棒的一步，就是讓我們能再多自訂一些這個 modal 的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 20.12,
          "end": 25.02,
          "en": "Right now we can pass in our own body, our own main content",
          "zh": "目前我們可以傳入自己的 body，也就是自己的主要內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 25.37,
          "end": 31.4,
          "en": "but what about the title, would be nice if we could pass in the title too and first setting the title,",
          "zh": "但標題呢？如果我們也能傳入標題就太好了，而要能設定標題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 31.4,
          "end": 35.18,
          "en": "there are of course two possible routes we could take;",
          "zh": "當然，我們有兩條可行的路線；"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 35.18,
          "end": 41.89,
          "en": "one option would be to have like modal title attributes here which we can set.",
          "zh": "其中一個選項是像這裡有個我們可以設定的 modal title 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 41.96,
          "end": 45.83,
          "en": "We could certainly do that and we could set this attribute here",
          "zh": "我們當然可以那樣做，我們可以在這裡設定這個屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 45.83,
          "end": 51.35,
          "en": "and then in modal.js in the connected callback which we don't have yet because we don't need it, we",
          "zh": "然後在 modal.js 的 connectedCallback 裡——我們目前還沒有它，因為還不需要——我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 51.35,
          "end": 58.25,
          "en": "could add it of course, we could extract the that attribute and we could then initialize our h1 tag",
          "zh": "當然可以加上它，我們可以取出那個屬性，然後用它來初始化我們的 h1 標籤"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 58.28,
          "end": 66.56,
          "en": "content here with the title we set up in our attribute and of course we could then also listen to",
          "zh": "內容，也就是我們在屬性裡設定的標題，而且我們當然也可以監聽"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 66.56,
          "end": 68.66,
          "en": "changes in that title,",
          "zh": "那個標題的變更，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 68.66,
          "end": 74.57,
          "en": "so in that modal title attribute and possibly update it in the modal when that changes. There would be",
          "zh": "也就是監聽 modal title 屬性的變化，並在它改變時更新 modal 裡的內容。這樣做"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 74.57,
          "end": 81.47,
          "en": "nothing wrong with that but I actually want to show you how to use multiple slots because maybe, we also",
          "zh": "沒有什麼不對，但我其實想示範如何使用多個 slot，因為也許我們也會"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 81.47,
          "end": 87.43,
          "en": "have a modal where we don't want to force the user into using a h1 tag here,",
          "zh": "有個 modal 是我們不想強迫使用者一定得用 h1 標籤的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 87.59,
          "end": 94.64,
          "en": "instead we want to let the user pass in any header the user wants and it could for example also be a",
          "zh": "而是想讓使用者傳入任何想要的標題內容，例如它也可以是"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 94.67,
          "end": 97.33,
          "en": "h1 tag with an h2 tag below it,",
          "zh": "一個 h1 標籤，下面再搭配一個 h2 標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 97.34,
          "end": 106.37,
          "en": "so to have a title and subtitle and for that, I want to use a slot here in my component too. The problem",
          "zh": "這樣就有主標題和副標題。為此，我也想在元件裡使用一個 slot。現在的"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 106.37,
          "end": 107.36,
          "en": "now of course is,",
          "zh": "問題當然是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 107.47999999999999,
          "end": 108.97,
          "en": "I now got two slots right,",
          "zh": "我現在有兩個 slot，對吧，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 108.97999999999999,
          "end": 111.95,
          "en": "I got one in the header and I got one in the main section.",
          "zh": "一個在 header 裡，一個在 main 區段裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 111.95,
          "end": 121.31,
          "en": "Now if we do that and we then go into the modal and we have let's say our h1 tag here, please confirm,",
          "zh": "現在如果我們這樣做，然後進到 modal，假設這裡有個 h1 標籤寫著 please confirm，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 122.33,
          "end": 130.05,
          "en": "if I do it like this and I reload this page and open the modal, then it might look right at first but",
          "zh": "如果我這樣做，重新載入這個頁面並開啟 modal，一開始看起來可能沒問題，但"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 130.05,
          "end": 136.65,
          "en": "if we inspect this, we actually see this is not really working out the way we want it to work, if we have",
          "zh": "如果我們檢查一下，其實會發現它並沒有照我們想要的方式運作，如果我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 136.65,
          "end": 139.57999999999998,
          "en": "a look at our modal, then in the header,",
          "zh": "看一下我們的 modal，在 header 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 139.8,
          "end": 147.93,
          "en": "well both is inserted - the paragraph and the h1 tag and the main section, there the slot basically is empty",
          "zh": "嗯，兩者都被插進去了——paragraph 和 h1 標籤，而 main 區段裡的 slot 基本上是空的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 148.47,
          "end": 155.57999999999998,
          "en": "because what essentially happens here is that the first slot catches all the content we pass into the",
          "zh": "因為這裡真正發生的情況是，第一個 slot 接收了我們傳入元件的所有內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 155.57999999999998,
          "end": 161.13,
          "en": "component and that makes a lot of sense because how would Javascript know",
          "zh": "這其實很合理，因為 JavaScript 要怎麼知道"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 161.31,
          "end": 166.39,
          "en": "which part here should end up in which of our slots.",
          "zh": "這裡的哪個部分應該進到哪一個 slot 裡呢。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 166.56,
          "end": 170.31,
          "en": "What we need is some kind of identification for each slot,",
          "zh": "我們需要的是為每個 slot 加上某種識別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 170.31,
          "end": 177.18,
          "en": "some ID we assign to a slot which we then can use when we pass in some content to target a specific",
          "zh": "某個指派給 slot 的 ID，這樣我們之後傳入內容時就能用它來指定特定的"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 177.18,
          "end": 180.39,
          "en": "slot and we can actually do that,",
          "zh": "slot，而我們確實可以這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 180.39,
          "end": 186.04,
          "en": "we can give our slots names and that is totally optional but something we can do",
          "zh": "我們可以為 slot 命名，這完全是選用的，但我們可以這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 186.19,
          "end": 190.32,
          "en": "and here I will give my slot a name by adding the name attribute,",
          "zh": "在這裡我會透過加上 name 屬性來給我的 slot 命名，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 190.34,
          "end": 195.93,
          "en": "this is how you do assign names to slots and I'll name this title and down there,",
          "zh": "這就是為 slot 指派名稱的方法，我把這個命名為 title，而下面那裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 195.93,
          "end": 203.91,
          "en": "we now could give this a name of main or we leave it unnamed and then any content which we pass in, which",
          "zh": "我們現在可以把它命名為 main，或者讓它保持未命名，這樣任何我們傳入、"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 203.91,
          "end": 207.99,
          "en": "does not target a specific name will automatically go in here.",
          "zh": "但沒有指定特定名稱的內容就會自動進到這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 207.99,
          "end": 209.68,
          "en": "Now let me show you how this works.",
          "zh": "現在讓我示範一下這是怎麼運作的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 209.85,
          "end": 212.61,
          "en": "So we get this slot named title here,",
          "zh": "所以我們這裡有了這個名為 title 的 slot，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 212.61,
          "end": 219.84,
          "en": "now back in the index.html file, the content which should go into my name slot will receive an",
          "zh": "現在回到 index.html 檔，應該進到我具名 slot 的內容會拿到一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 219.84,
          "end": 225,
          "en": "extra slot attribute and there I simply point at the name,",
          "zh": "額外的 slot 屬性，而我在那裡直接指向該名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 225,
          "end": 232.02,
          "en": "so in my case, title. So I use title here on the slot attribute of the content that should go into that",
          "zh": "以我的情況就是 title。所以我在應該進到那個 title slot 的內容上，把 slot 屬性設成 title，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 232.05,
          "end": 236.13,
          "en": "title slot because I have title as a name here.",
          "zh": "因為我這裡的名稱是 title。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 236.31,
          "end": 242.94,
          "en": "The second slot has no name and therefore the content which has no slot attribute automatically goes",
          "zh": "第二個 slot 沒有名稱，因此沒有 slot 屬性的內容會自動進到"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 242.94,
          "end": 245.03,
          "en": "to that default slot and",
          "zh": "那個預設 slot，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 245.19,
          "end": 248.61,
          "en": "I can show this to you if I now reload this page, here",
          "zh": "我可以示範給你看，如果我現在重新載入這個頁面，你看"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 249.03,
          "end": 256.44,
          "en": "if we now inspect this, we see the header slot has the h1 tag and if I go into the main section, this",
          "zh": "如果我們現在檢查一下，會看到 header 的 slot 有 h1 標籤，而如果我進到 main 區段，這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 256.44,
          "end": 264.18,
          "en": "slot has the paragraph tag and now we got a modal with more options for us to customize it because now",
          "zh": "slot 有 paragraph 標籤，現在我們的 modal 有了更多可以自訂的選項，因為現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 264.18,
          "end": 267.71,
          "en": "we got multiple slots where we can pass in content",
          "zh": "我們有多個 slot 可以傳入內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 268.08,
          "end": 272.89,
          "en": "and of course we can also still assign a default value here,",
          "zh": "而且我們當然還是可以在這裡指派預設值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 272.90999999999997,
          "end": 278.85,
          "en": "so for example for this named slot just as we can do it for the unnamed slot, I will add a default content",
          "zh": "例如對這個具名 slot，就像我們對未命名 slot 可以做的一樣，我會加上一段預設內容"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 278.85,
          "end": 286.03,
          "en": "of please confirm payment in case we would not pass in content for this slot.",
          "zh": "「please confirm payment」，以防我們沒有為這個 slot 傳入內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 286.08,
          "end": 287.37,
          "en": "Now in our case we do,",
          "zh": "而在我們的例子裡，我們有傳入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 287.37,
          "end": 292.56,
          "en": "so when I reload, we should still see please confirm instead of my default content of please confirm",
          "zh": "所以當我重新載入，我們應該還是看到 please confirm，而不是我的預設內容 please confirm"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 292.56,
          "end": 294.9,
          "en": "payment and indeed we do",
          "zh": "payment，確實如此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 294.9,
          "end": 300.7,
          "en": "and now all the things you already learned apply. So we can now style this content which we do pass in",
          "zh": "而現在你已經學過的所有東西都適用。所以我們現在可以為實際傳入的內容設定樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 300.72,
          "end": 302.87,
          "en": "from inside our main app",
          "zh": "從我們的主要應用程式裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 302.88,
          "end": 310.16,
          "en": "so to say, from our main document, we can style that here in the light DOM or in our modal with the slotted",
          "zh": "可以這麼說，從我們的主要文件，我們可以在 light DOM 這裡設定樣式，或在 modal 裡用 slotted"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 310.16,
          "end": 312.29,
          "en": "special selector.",
          "zh": "這個特殊選擇器來設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 312.3,
          "end": 318.78,
          "en": "So here, this style in particular has no effect anymore because we can't target the h1 tag that's passed",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，特別是這段樣式已經沒有作用了，因為我們無法從外部指定傳入"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 318.84,
          "end": 321.09,
          "en": "into the shadow DOM from outside,",
          "zh": "shadow DOM 的 h1 標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 321.09,
          "end": 326.82,
          "en": "if we would want to target anything that gets passed in, we would have to use the slotted attribute like",
          "zh": "如果我們想指定任何被傳入的內容，就必須像這樣使用 slotted"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 326.82,
          "end": 327.65,
          "en": "this.",
          "zh": "這樣的寫法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 327.66,
          "end": 336.81,
          "en": "So now here, I simply add my condition and say I want to style slotted h1's and now if I reload this, we have",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我只要加上我的條件，說我想為 slotted 的 h1 設定樣式，現在如果我重新載入，就會有"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 336.81,
          "end": 338.38,
          "en": "that smaller text here.",
          "zh": "這裡這個比較小的文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 338.4,
          "end": 340.35,
          "en": "So this is something we can still do,",
          "zh": "所以這是我們仍然可以做的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 340.38,
          "end": 343.17,
          "en": "basically what you already learned about slots.",
          "zh": "基本上就是你已經學過的 slot 相關內容。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "17206154",
      "title": "Listening to Slot Content Changes",
      "lectureOrder": 609,
      "videoOrder": 535,
      "sourceHash": "4849df3aefe9e08617c91c3e3e062f0fdd37fecc6b272e7cc81e80879ccc2219",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.29,
          "end": 10.72,
          "en": "Now with named slots explored, let's dig a bit deeper into slots and let's see how we could actually",
          "zh": "現在我們已經探索過 named slot，讓我們再深入一點瞭解 slot，看看我們要怎麼"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 11.05,
          "end": 16.21,
          "en": "get access to the content we pass in our slot in our code in the component",
          "zh": "在元件裡的程式碼中取得我們傳入 slot 的內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 16.25,
          "end": 20.95,
          "en": "and with that I don't mean get access in the sense of render it, what we do here automatically by simply",
          "zh": "我指的不是為了渲染而取得存取，那是我們只要"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 20.95,
          "end": 22.09,
          "en": "using the slot",
          "zh": "使用 slot 就會自動完成的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 22.09,
          "end": 30.7,
          "en": "but what if we would need to kind of read our list of data, our list of HTML nodes that gets passed into",
          "zh": "而是如果我們需要讀取那份資料清單，也就是傳入我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 30.7,
          "end": 32.11,
          "en": "our slots.",
          "zh": "slot 的 HTML 節點清單呢。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 32.11,
          "end": 39.67,
          "en": "Now for that let me first of all show you something else, after setting up my innerHTML template",
          "zh": "為此，讓我先示範另一件事，在設定好我的 innerHTML template"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 39.67,
          "end": 48.14,
          "en": "here, so the next line after this statement basically. I want to get access to all my slots and I'll store",
          "zh": "之後，基本上就是這個敘述的下一行。我想取得所有 slot 的存取，並把它們"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 48.14,
          "end": 49.54,
          "en": "them in a constant",
          "zh": "存到一個常數裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 49.54,
          "end": 55.89,
          "en": "and we can easily query for them on our shadow root with the query selector all method and then querying",
          "zh": "我們可以很輕鬆地在 shadow root 上用 querySelectorAll 方法查詢它們，查詢"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 55.89,
          "end": 61.47,
          "en": "for the slot element because this is a normal HTML tag by which we can query of course.",
          "zh": "slot 元素，因為這是一般的 HTML 標籤，我們當然可以這樣查詢。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 61.47,
          "end": 64.69,
          "en": "Now here we can access our slots,",
          "zh": "現在我們可以在這裡存取我們的 slot，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 64.74,
          "end": 71.75,
          "en": "this will basically be an array or a node list of HTML elements and we have two slots -",
          "zh": "這基本上會是 HTML 元素的陣列或 node list，而我們有兩個 slot——"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 71.76,
          "end": 73.8,
          "en": "the first one will be at index 0,",
          "zh": "第一個會在索引 0，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 73.8,
          "end": 75.81,
          "en": "the second one at index 1.",
          "zh": "第二個在索引 1。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 75.81,
          "end": 79.28999999999999,
          "en": "Now let's say we want to have a look at our second slot,",
          "zh": "現在假設我們想看一下第二個 slot，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 79.32,
          "end": 85.59,
          "en": "so the one with index 1 and then we can add an event listener here and the event to which we can listen",
          "zh": "也就是索引 1 的那個，然後我們可以在這裡加上 event listener，而我們可以監聽的事件"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 85.86,
          "end": 91.53999999999999,
          "en": "is the slot change event and that will be triggered whenever new content arrives,",
          "zh": "是 slot change 事件，只要新內容進來就會觸發，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 91.71000000000001,
          "end": 98.91,
          "en": "which will happen at least once when our shadow DOM basically is used to render our component into the",
          "zh": "這至少會發生一次，當我們的 shadow DOM 基本上被用來把元件渲染到"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 98.91,
          "end": 104.32,
          "en": "real DOM and we project the content we pass into our component into our slot,",
          "zh": "真實的 DOM，而我們把傳入元件的內容投影到 slot 裡時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 104.34,
          "end": 109.89,
          "en": "this will be the first time this triggers but then also if we would update it programmatically from outside",
          "zh": "這會是它第一次觸發，但之後如果我們從外部用程式方式更新它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 110.25,
          "end": 116.19,
          "en": "and the content we pass in would change, then slot change for this given slot would also trigger again",
          "zh": "而且傳入的內容改變了，那麼這個特定 slot 的 slot change 也會再次觸發，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 116.94,
          "end": 123.42,
          "en": "and in this function which then triggers, we get an event object and in here most importantly, we'll",
          "zh": "而在這個被觸發的函式中，我們會拿到一個 event 物件，在這裡最重要的是，我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 123.42,
          "end": 127.95,
          "en": "be able to analyze the content that's inside of our slot.",
          "zh": "將能夠分析 slot 裡面的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 127.95,
          "end": 134.82,
          "en": "So here I will actually console dir, dir prints an object in the console which we can inspect instead",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我其實會用 console.dir，dir 會在 console 裡印出一個我們可以檢視的物件，而不是"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 134.82,
          "end": 141.9,
          "en": "of the HTML element console log with print and there, I will print that slot",
          "zh": "用 console.log 印出 HTML 元素，在那裡，我會印出那個我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 141.93,
          "end": 143.76,
          "en": "we're listening to.",
          "zh": "正在監聽的 slot。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 143.76,
          "end": 147.56,
          "en": "So now if I save this and I reload,",
          "zh": "現在如果我儲存這個並重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 147.56,
          "end": 153.04,
          "en": "you see we now have a slot output here and that gets printed by this line,",
          "zh": "你看，我們現在這裡有一個 slot 的輸出，那是由這一行印出來的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 153.05,
          "end": 158.43,
          "en": "so that means that the slot change event did indeed fire, which it as I mentioned does when we render",
          "zh": "這表示 slot change 事件確實觸發了，就像我提到的，當我們把"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 158.43,
          "end": 163.67000000000002,
          "en": "this component to the screen because that is when the slot here will be replaced with the projected",
          "zh": "這個元件渲染到畫面上時就會觸發，因為那時這裡的 slot 會被投影進來的"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 163.67000000000002,
          "end": 165.77,
          "en": "content for the first time",
          "zh": "內容首次取代，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 165.95,
          "end": 173.99,
          "en": "and if we now have a look in the slot here, we can see a couple of interesting elements but some very",
          "zh": "而如果我們現在看一下這裡的 slot，可以看到幾個有趣的元素，但有一些非常"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 173.99,
          "end": 175.69,
          "en": "interesting data can be seen",
          "zh": "有趣的資料可以看到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 175.79,
          "end": 180.91,
          "en": "if we call the assigned nodes method on our slot,",
          "zh": "如果我們在 slot 上呼叫 assignedNodes 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 180.98,
          "end": 182.51,
          "en": "so this is not a property,",
          "zh": "所以這不是屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 182.51,
          "end": 184.06,
          "en": "this is a method.",
          "zh": "這是方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 184.52,
          "end": 192.29,
          "en": "If we do that and we go back, if I reload, then we see an array of all the content that was projected",
          "zh": "如果我們這麼做然後回來，如果我重新載入，就會看到一個陣列，包含所有被投影"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 192.41,
          "end": 194.15,
          "en": "into our slot.",
          "zh": "到 slot 裡的內容。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 194.15,
          "end": 200.39,
          "en": "Now you might be wondering why we have four elements instead of just one paragraph tag,",
          "zh": "現在你可能會想，為什麼我們有四個元素，而不是只有一個 paragraph 標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 200.63,
          "end": 205.37,
          "en": "the reason for that simply is that the whitespace in front of the paragraph tag and after the paragraph tag",
          "zh": "原因很簡單，就是 paragraph 標籤前面和後面的空白"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 205.69,
          "end": 212.01,
          "en": "also is treated as text. In the end we have this paragraph tag we're interested in and if we would",
          "zh": "也被當成文字處理。最後我們有這個感興趣的 paragraph 標籤，而如果我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 213.17000000000002,
          "end": 219.02,
          "en": "optimize our code here and basically write this all in line which is harder to read but gets rid of",
          "zh": "在這裡最佳化程式碼，基本上把它全部寫成一行，這樣比較難讀，但可以擺脫"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 219.02,
          "end": 225.13,
          "en": "all the excess whitespace, if we would do that here for our component in the HTML file, then you would see",
          "zh": "所有多餘的空白，如果我們在 HTML 檔裡對元件這麼做，你就會看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 225.14,
          "end": 230.93,
          "en": "we only have the paragraph element in there and this is now the paragraph DOM node which gets projected",
          "zh": "裡面只有 paragraph 元素，而這就是被投影"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 231.02,
          "end": 232.18,
          "en": "into our slot,",
          "zh": "到 slot 裡的 paragraph DOM 節點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 232.22,
          "end": 235.98,
          "en": "so this is also not part of the shadow DOM but still of the light DOM,",
          "zh": "所以它同樣不屬於 shadow DOM，而是仍屬於 light DOM，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 236.01,
          "end": 244.24,
          "en": "just the content at which our slot points so to say. Now I do now restructure this again to make it easier",
          "zh": "可以說是我們 slot 指向的內容。現在我又把它重新整理回去，讓它比較容易"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 244.24,
          "end": 244.8,
          "en": "to read",
          "zh": "閱讀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 244.87,
          "end": 250.09,
          "en": "but now if I reload, I get these four elements again but again it is the paragraph tag which we get in",
          "zh": "但現在如果我重新載入，我又會拿到這四個元素，不過我們最後拿到的還是 paragraph 標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 250.09,
          "end": 250.98,
          "en": "the end here",
          "zh": "就是這裡最後這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 251.11,
          "end": 257.26,
          "en": "and if you ever need to get access to the content that is projected into your slot, then this is how",
          "zh": "如果你將來需要存取被投影到 slot 裡的內容，這就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 257.26,
          "end": 258.13,
          "en": "you can do it,",
          "zh": "你可以怎麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 258.25,
          "end": 265.83,
          "en": "you can use assigned nodes and as a little side note, on the protected element, you also find this assigned",
          "zh": "你可以使用 assignedNodes，另外補充一下，在被投影的元素上，你也可以找到這個 assigned"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 265.84,
          "end": 273.34000000000003,
          "en": "slot property here which you can on the other hand used to find out into which slot this was projected.",
          "zh": "slot 屬性，反過來，你可以用它來查出這個元素被投影到哪個 slot。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 273.64,
          "end": 280.42,
          "en": "So this also may be an interesting information depending on which kind of application you are writing.",
          "zh": "所以這也可能是有趣的資訊，取決於你正在寫什麼樣的應用程式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 280.51,
          "end": 287.56,
          "en": "So slot change combined with assigned nodes can be very helpful if you for example also have an application",
          "zh": "所以如果你例如有個應用程式，其中 slot 裡的內容"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 287.83,
          "end": 291.01,
          "en": "where the content in your slot might change at runtime too,",
          "zh": "在執行時也可能改變，那麼 slot change 搭配 assignedNodes 就會非常有幫助，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 291.13,
          "end": 296.5,
          "en": "so not just this initial change which we have here but also a change at a later point of time maybe",
          "zh": "不只是我們這裡的這個初始變更，也可能是之後某個時間點的變更，也許"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 296.5,
          "end": 302.11,
          "en": "because you loaded some data from the web and you want to change something in your modal when that is",
          "zh": "是因為你從網路載入了一些資料，而當那件事"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 302.11,
          "end": 302.44,
          "en": "done.",
          "zh": "完成時，你想在 modal 裡改變某些東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 303.07,
          "end": 308.5,
          "en": "So this is just another thing I wanted to show you which can be helpful when you're working with slots.",
          "zh": "所以這只是另一個我想示範給你看、在處理 slot 時可能會很有幫助的東西。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "17206158",
      "title": "Closing the Modal",
      "lectureOrder": 610,
      "videoOrder": 536,
      "sourceHash": "c08b357878c003ecb68857fde2c9c55e77026919ec3174d8f51b40d6380cf61d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.24,
          "end": 5.36,
          "en": "So now that we covered a lot about slots,",
          "zh": "現在我們已經談了很多關於 slot 的內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.39,
          "end": 10.16,
          "en": "let's finish up this modal by tweaking some of its styling again",
          "zh": "讓我們再次調整一些樣式來完成這個 modal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.16,
          "end": 15.89,
          "en": "but most importantly and first of all, by making these buttons work. Right now I can click cancel and",
          "zh": "但最重要的是，首先要讓這些按鈕能運作。現在我可以點 cancel 和"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 15.89,
          "end": 17.9,
          "en": "okay and nothing will happen.",
          "zh": "okay，但什麼事都不會發生。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.9,
          "end": 25.22,
          "en": "Now I want to close the modal in both cases but I want to dispatch my own events to which I can listen",
          "zh": "現在我希望這兩種情況都能關閉 modal，但我想派送自己的事件，讓我能夠從元件外部"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 25.22,
          "end": 27.09,
          "en": "from outside my component,",
          "zh": "監聽它們，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 27.14,
          "end": 33.92,
          "en": "so from inside my main application, my main Javascript logic which runs int my main document so that I",
          "zh": "也就是從我的主要應用程式，也就是執行在我主要文件裡的主要 JavaScript 邏輯，這樣我"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 33.92,
          "end": 40.52,
          "en": "know whether the user has confirmed this modal or cancelled it because right now what I want to be able",
          "zh": "就能知道使用者是確認還是取消了這個 modal，因為現在我最終想做到的"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 40.52,
          "end": 48.68,
          "en": "to do in the end is that I add an event listener here to my modal object and keep in mind, my modal object",
          "zh": "是，我在這裡為我的 modal 物件加上 event listener，請記住，我的 modal 物件"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 48.71,
          "end": 54.95,
          "en": "is really just my own custom component and there, it would be nice if we had like a confirm listener",
          "zh": "其實就是我自己寫的 custom component，而如果能在那裡有個像是 confirm listener 就太好了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 55.19,
          "end": 57.62,
          "en": "and confirm is not a built-in event,",
          "zh": "而 confirm 並不是內建事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 57.62,
          "end": 67.43,
          "en": "so right now this will never trigger where I can do something, so most of the time in my application",
          "zh": "所以現在它永遠不會觸發讓我能做點什麼。所以在我的應用程式裡，大多數時候"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 67.43,
          "end": 72.8,
          "en": "I would probably want to do something like create a payment request which I sent to some backend once",
          "zh": "我大概會想做一些事，例如建立一個付款請求，在使用者確認後送到某個後端，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 72.8,
          "end": 76.43,
          "en": "the user confirmed or where I also can do something",
          "zh": "或者我也可以做點什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 76.64,
          "end": 78.37,
          "en": "if the user declines this,",
          "zh": "如果使用者拒絕的話，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 78.41,
          "end": 84.05,
          "en": "so if the user cancels this, then maybe I want to reset some state in my application.",
          "zh": "所以如果使用者取消，也許我想重設應用程式裡的某些狀態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 84.17,
          "end": 87.84,
          "en": "Of course here I'll not focus on the application logic,",
          "zh": "當然，這裡我不會聚焦在應用程式邏輯上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 87.92,
          "end": 92.99000000000001,
          "en": "I want to focus on the component and how we add our own events there",
          "zh": "我想聚焦在元件，以及我們要如何在其中加上自己的事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 92.99000000000001,
          "end": 97.39,
          "en": "but I just want to give you some ideas of what you could do there in a real application,",
          "zh": "我只是想給你一些概念，讓你知道在真實應用程式裡可以做些什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 97.4,
          "end": 102.96000000000001,
          "en": "so outside of your web component will focus on making these customer events work here now,",
          "zh": "所以在你的 web component 之外，我們現在要聚焦在讓這些 custom event 能夠運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 103.07,
          "end": 106.61,
          "en": "so confirm and cancel is the go. For that",
          "zh": "所以 confirm 和 cancel 就是重點。為此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 106.61,
          "end": 108.56,
          "en": "let's dive into our modal again",
          "zh": "讓我們再次深入我們的 modal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 108.56,
          "end": 112.78,
          "en": "and there we have these buttons. Since these buttons are part of the shadow DOM,",
          "zh": "那裡有這些按鈕。由於這些按鈕是 shadow DOM 的一部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 112.88,
          "end": 116.78999999999999,
          "en": "we have to create listeners to these buttons inside of our shadow DOM.",
          "zh": "我們必須在 shadow DOM 裡面為這些按鈕建立 listener。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 116.84,
          "end": 125.18,
          "en": "So for that, I'll add another constants here in the constructor below my slots listeners I added",
          "zh": "為此，我會在建構函式裡，在我上一堂課加的 slot listener 下面再加上其他常數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 125.18,
          "end": 131.75,
          "en": "in the last lectures and there I'll have the cancel button and for this, I'll give this button an ID",
          "zh": "在那裡我會有 cancel 按鈕，為此我會給這個按鈕一個 ID"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 131.75,
          "end": 139.5,
          "en": "of cancel button, maybe like this, confirm button",
          "zh": "叫做 cancel button，大概是這樣，還有 confirm button，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 139.69,
          "end": 144.61,
          "en": "and now I can select by that ID, so I'll access my shadow root, use the query selector,",
          "zh": "現在我就能用那個 ID 來選取，所以我會存取我的 shadow root，使用 querySelector，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 144.7,
          "end": 151.54,
          "en": "you could also use get element by ID of course and then select the cancel button ID here and then",
          "zh": "當然你也可以用 getElementById，然後在這裡選取 cancel button 這個 ID，接著"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 151.54,
          "end": 159.13,
          "en": "I'll duplicate this to also select my confirm button here with the confirm button ID.",
          "zh": "我會複製這段，用 confirm button 這個 ID 來選取我的 confirm 按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 159.79,
          "end": 165.11,
          "en": "So now that I have access to these two buttons, I can register listeners here in my component.",
          "zh": "現在我已經能存取這兩個按鈕，我就可以在元件裡註冊 listener。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 165.4,
          "end": 173.14,
          "en": "So let's maybe start with the cancel button here and on the cancel button, I want to hide the modal and",
          "zh": "那我們也許就從這裡的 cancel 按鈕開始，在 cancel 按鈕上，我想隱藏 modal，並且"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 173.14,
          "end": 181.95,
          "en": "I want to dispatch this custom cancel event to which I'm listening from outside. Therefore, I'll first",
          "zh": "我想派送這個我在外部監聽的 custom cancel 事件。因此，我首先"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 181.95,
          "end": 188.61,
          "en": "of all add a new method here and I'll name it hide, I could turn this into a private method by adding",
          "zh": "會在這裡加一個新方法，命名為 hide，我可以透過在前面加"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 188.61,
          "end": 192.56,
          "en": "a leading underscore and always keep in mind, it's not really private,",
          "zh": "一個底線讓它變成私有方法，但請永遠記住，它並不是真正的私有，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 192.57,
          "end": 194.52,
          "en": "you can still call it from outside,",
          "zh": "你還是可以從外部呼叫它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 194.61,
          "end": 199.01,
          "en": "I just add this to show hey this should only be used from inside,",
          "zh": "我加上這個只是要表示，嘿，這應該只在內部使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 199.07999999999998,
          "end": 202.21,
          "en": "if you then don't follow that rule, well you can do that",
          "zh": "如果你之後不遵守那個規則，那也隨你，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 202.32,
          "end": 208.41,
          "en": "but here I want to keep it as a public method because even though we're not doing it in our app, you",
          "zh": "但在這裡我想讓它保持為公開方法，因為雖然我們的應用程式沒有這麼做，你"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 208.41,
          "end": 213.9,
          "en": "could of course definitely imagine an application where you want to hide a modal from outside,",
          "zh": "當然完全可以想像一個應用程式，你會想從外部隱藏 modal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 213.9,
          "end": 220.47,
          "en": "so from your main application instead from inside of the component. Now how do we hide it?",
          "zh": "也就是從你的主要應用程式，而不是從元件內部。那我們要怎麼隱藏它呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 220.54,
          "end": 226.8,
          "en": "Well in the end it's all about setting our open attributes to none or to remove it",
          "zh": "說到底，重點就是把我們的 open 屬性設為 none，或把它移除，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 226.89,
          "end": 232.23,
          "en": "and we do that not with set attribute but with remove attribute and there,",
          "zh": "而我們不是用 setAttribute，而是用 removeAttribute，在那裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 232.23,
          "end": 242.65,
          "en": "I want to remove my opened attribute. We can add an extra check here to see if this has the attribute",
          "zh": "我想移除我的 opened 屬性。我們可以在這裡加一個額外檢查，看看它是否具有該屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 243.04,
          "end": 246.64,
          "en": "opened before we then try to remove it of course.",
          "zh": "也就是 opened，然後當然才嘗試移除它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 249.39,
          "end": 257.01,
          "en": "Besides that, I want to set this is open to false of course to update this property as well",
          "zh": "除此之外，我當然想把 this.isOpen 設為 false，好一併更新這個屬性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 257.01,
          "end": 263.22,
          "en": "and with that, the modal will already be closed because of that opened attribute which we use in our",
          "zh": "如此一來，modal 就會因為我們在"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 263.23,
          "end": 265.59,
          "en": "CSS styles here.",
          "zh": "這裡的 CSS 樣式裡使用的 opened 屬性而關閉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 265.68,
          "end": 268.8,
          "en": "So therefore we have that functionality, the custom event is missing",
          "zh": "所以我們已經有那個功能了，還缺 custom event，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 268.8,
          "end": 270.48,
          "en": "but I'll come back to that later.",
          "zh": "但我之後會再回來處理它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 270.48,
          "end": 275.94,
          "en": "So for now let's continue with the event listener on the cancel button in the constructor, there we want",
          "zh": "所以現在讓我們繼續處理建構函式裡 cancel 按鈕上的 event listener，在那裡我們想"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 275.94,
          "end": 282.87,
          "en": "to listen to an ordinary click which of course is a built-in event, built into core Javascript and the",
          "zh": "監聽一般的 click，這當然是內建事件，內建於核心 JavaScript 和"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 282.87,
          "end": 288.38,
          "en": "browser and upon a click, I want to trigger this hide,",
          "zh": "瀏覽器中，而在點擊時，我想觸發這個 hide，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 288.39,
          "end": 290.23,
          "en": "so this hide method",
          "zh": "也就是這個 hide 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 290.46,
          "end": 297.21,
          "en": "and of course I'll bind the this keyword here to ensure that this inside of hide refers to the class",
          "zh": "當然我會在這裡綁定 this 關鍵字，以確保 hide 裡面的 this 指向這個 class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 297.45,
          "end": 305.58,
          "en": "and not to the button which is the event trigger. Now I'll duplicate this to also hook up my confirm",
          "zh": "而不是指向作為事件觸發來源的按鈕。現在我會複製這段，也接上我的 confirm"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 305.67,
          "end": 307.31,
          "en": "button and there,",
          "zh": "按鈕，在那裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 307.32,
          "end": 308.96,
          "en": "I also want to hide this modal.",
          "zh": "我也想要隱藏這個 modal。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 308.97,
          "end": 310.44,
          "en": "Now we already see a problem here,",
          "zh": "現在我們在這裡已經看到一個問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 310.65,
          "end": 313.92,
          "en": "I definitely don't want to run the same logic two times.",
          "zh": "我絕對不想把同樣的邏輯執行兩次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 313.92,
          "end": 322.35,
          "en": "So what I will do instead is, I'll add a private method here which I'll name cancel and I'll add one",
          "zh": "所以我要改為在這裡加一個私有方法，命名為 cancel，再加一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 322.35,
          "end": 325.67,
          "en": "which I'll name confirm.",
          "zh": "命名為 confirm 的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 325.92,
          "end": 335.06,
          "en": "Now in both, I will call this open and here we don't need to bind this because if we're calling it like this",
          "zh": "現在在這兩者中，我會呼叫 this.open，在這裡我們不需要綁定 this，因為如果我們像這樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 335.06,
          "end": 336.51,
          "en": "from inside the class,",
          "zh": "從 class 內部呼叫它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 336.71,
          "end": 341.45,
          "en": "the class itself is calling a method and therefore this in the called method will refer to the class",
          "zh": "是 class 自己在呼叫方法，因此被呼叫方法裡的 this 也會指向這個 class，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 341.45,
          "end": 342.40999999999997,
          "en": "too,",
          "zh": "同樣地，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 342.53,
          "end": 345.56,
          "en": "so I'll also call hide here,",
          "zh": "所以我在這裡也會呼叫 hide，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 345.68,
          "end": 346.13,
          "en": "sorry",
          "zh": "抱歉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 346.13,
          "end": 347.19,
          "en": "here it should also be",
          "zh": "這裡也應該是"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 347.25,
          "end": 351.17,
          "en": "hide of course, not open. So it should be hide in both",
          "zh": "hide，當然不是 open。所以兩邊都應該是 hide，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 351.17,
          "end": 358.4,
          "en": "but now we can dispatch different custom events here. So let's tweak that and go up and for the cancel",
          "zh": "但現在我們可以在這裡派送不同的 custom event。所以讓我們調整一下，往上到 cancel"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 358.4,
          "end": 359.32,
          "en": "button,",
          "zh": "按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 359.42,
          "end": 367.1,
          "en": "I will now actually call my private cancel method and for confirm, my private confirm method",
          "zh": "我現在實際上會呼叫我的私有 cancel 方法，而 confirm 則呼叫我的私有 confirm 方法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 367.1,
          "end": 371.68,
          "en": "and right now, they will both just call hide but that will change soon.",
          "zh": "而現在它們都只會呼叫 hide，但這很快就會改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 372.62,
          "end": 379.06,
          "en": "So now with that, we should already have a working modal, such that when I click cancel, it gets hidden",
          "zh": "如此一來，我們應該已經有個能運作的 modal，也就是當我點 cancel 時它會被隱藏，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 379.58,
          "end": 384.07,
          "en": "and if I open it again, I can also hide it and close it with",
          "zh": "而如果我再次開啟它，我也可以隱藏它，並用"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 384.1,
          "end": 385.06,
          "en": "okay",
          "zh": "okay 關閉它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 385.12,
          "end": 392.36,
          "en": "and you can see I can reopen it even though I have an extra check here in my main app, in my index.html file",
          "zh": "你可以看到我能重新開啟它，即使我在主要應用程式、我的 index.html 檔裡有額外檢查，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 392.38,
          "end": 398.47,
          "en": "where I check for whether it is not open yet with the is open property and I can still reopen it after",
          "zh": "在那裡我用 isOpen 屬性檢查它是否還沒開啟，而我仍然可以在"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 398.47,
          "end": 404.62,
          "en": "closing it because I do update this is open property in my modal as well.",
          "zh": "關閉它之後重新開啟，因為我在 modal 裡也確實更新了 this.isOpen 這個屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 406.07,
          "end": 411.98,
          "en": "So this is the first important step but the more important and more interesting step of course now is",
          "zh": "所以這是第一個重要的步驟，但接下來更重要也更有趣的步驟當然是"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 411.98,
          "end": 414.23,
          "en": "to emit our own custom event,",
          "zh": "發出我們自己的 custom event，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 414.23,
          "end": 415.61,
          "en": "let's do that next.",
          "zh": "我們接下來就來做。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "17206160",
      "title": "Dispatching Custom Events",
      "lectureOrder": 611,
      "videoOrder": 537,
      "sourceHash": "1fe5960debe51c6312238b84ed887242944ced0713de29556dcbea70e92c6678",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.26,
          "end": 9.97,
          "en": "So now that we can close and open our modal, let's dispatch our own events. Now how do we do that?",
          "zh": "現在我們可以關閉和開啟 modal 了，讓我們派送自己的事件。那我們要怎麼做呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 9.97,
          "end": 17.02,
          "en": "Well for that, let me first of all accept, on the canceled event, the event object. We get this automatically,",
          "zh": "為此，讓我首先在 canceled 事件上接收 event 物件。我們會自動拿到它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 17.32,
          "end": 23.29,
          "en": "we get this automatically because we used this click event listener here and Javascript just works in",
          "zh": "之所以會自動拿到，是因為我們在這裡用了這個 click event listener，而 JavaScript 的運作方式就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 23.29,
          "end": 29.5,
          "en": "a way that the method which gets triggered for this event automatically receives an object with some",
          "zh": "為這個事件觸發的方法會自動收到一個物件，裡面有些"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 29.59,
          "end": 33.1,
          "en": "metadata about the event that was created by Javascript,",
          "zh": "關於 JavaScript 所建立之事件的詮釋資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 33.1,
          "end": 35.25,
          "en": "so about that built-in event.",
          "zh": "也就是關於那個內建事件的資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 35.35,
          "end": 38.75,
          "en": "Now we don't need that event to dispatch our own once,",
          "zh": "現在我們不需要那個事件來派送我們自己的事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 38.87,
          "end": 41.26,
          "en": "we will not copy it or anything like that",
          "zh": "我們不會複製它或做類似的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 41.62,
          "end": 48.22,
          "en": "but on this event with event target, I get access to the target that is responsible for this event,",
          "zh": "但在這個事件上，透過 event.target 我可以存取負責這個事件的目標，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 48.22,
          "end": 56.62,
          "en": "so in my case the button and this button, just like every other HTML element, is capable of dispatching",
          "zh": "以我的情況就是按鈕，而這個按鈕就像其他每個 HTML 元素一樣，能夠用"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 56.92,
          "end": 65.31,
          "en": "a new event with the dispatch event method. The dispatch event method takes a new event,",
          "zh": "dispatchEvent 方法派送一個新事件。dispatchEvent 方法需要一個新事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 65.31,
          "end": 70.35,
          "en": "so a totally new event, not this event we receive here, a new event as an argument.",
          "zh": "一個全新的事件，不是我們這裡收到的事件，而是把新事件當作引數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 70.35,
          "end": 73.5,
          "en": "So here I'll name this cancel event,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我會把這個命名為 cancelEvent，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 73.5,
          "end": 74.86,
          "en": "the name is totally up to you",
          "zh": "名稱完全由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 74.91,
          "end": 80.73,
          "en": "and I create it with the new keyword which we use in Javascript to create new objects based on constructor",
          "zh": "我用 new 關鍵字建立它，我們在 JavaScript 裡用這個關鍵字根據建構函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 80.73,
          "end": 84.59,
          "en": "functions or classes and I'll use the built-in event object,",
          "zh": "或 class 建立新物件，而我會使用內建的 Event 物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 84.6,
          "end": 93.03999999999999,
          "en": "so this is built into Javascript, just as the HTML element is. So now I can create a new event here and we",
          "zh": "這是 JavaScript 內建的，就像 HTMLElement 一樣。現在我可以在這裡建立一個新事件，而我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 93.03999999999999,
          "end": 99.52000000000001,
          "en": "give this event our own name by passing it in the constructor here, between quotation marks,",
          "zh": "透過在引號之間把它傳入建構函式，來給這個事件我們自己的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 99.52000000000001,
          "end": 103.18,
          "en": "so as a string and here I'll name this cancel",
          "zh": "也就是以字串形式，而這裡我會把它命名為 cancel，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 103.18,
          "end": 108.49000000000001,
          "en": "and this is exactly the name to which we will be able to listen to from outside later.",
          "zh": "這正是我們之後能從外部監聽的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 108.49000000000001,
          "end": 115.39,
          "en": "So here, I am listening to the cancel event in my index.html file and this should work later because",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我在 index.html 檔裡監聽 cancel 事件，這之後應該會運作，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 115.42,
          "end": 118.99000000000001,
          "en": "I'm dispatching an event named cancel here.",
          "zh": "我在這裡派送的是一個名為 cancel 的事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 119.02000000000001,
          "end": 124.06,
          "en": "So now I pass this cancel event to my dispatch event function",
          "zh": "現在我把這個 cancel 事件傳給我的 dispatchEvent 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 124.27,
          "end": 126.79,
          "en": "and with that, let's see if that works,",
          "zh": "這樣一來，讓我們看看它是否能運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 126.85,
          "end": 132.24,
          "en": "let's go back and reload here, click that and click cancel",
          "zh": "讓我們回到這裡並重新載入，點那個再點 cancel，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 132.43,
          "end": 138.49,
          "en": "and we don't see canceled here in the console, even though we should be logging that here when we listen",
          "zh": "而我們沒有在 console 裡看到 canceled，即使當我們監聽"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 138.5,
          "end": 139.93,
          "en": "to the cancel event.",
          "zh": "cancel 事件時應該要在這裡印出它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 139.93,
          "end": 147.82999999999998,
          "en": "So somehow our own event doesn't really seem to be dispatched on our component and indeed it isn't and",
          "zh": "所以我們自己的事件似乎沒有真正派送在我們的元件上，確實如此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 147.82999999999998,
          "end": 153.38,
          "en": "it is dispatched on the button because, and that is the only reason why I accepted the event argument",
          "zh": "它是派送在按鈕上，因為——這也是我接收 event 引數的唯一原因——"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 153.38,
          "end": 154.15,
          "en": "here,",
          "zh": "在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 154.2,
          "end": 160.13,
          "en": "we're dispatching it on the event target of the cancel event or of the cancel event handler I should",
          "zh": "我們是把它派送在 cancel 事件的 event.target 上，或者我應該說是 cancel 事件處理函式的"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 160.13,
          "end": 160.91,
          "en": "say",
          "zh": "目標上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 160.91,
          "end": 164.55,
          "en": "and that event handler is used on the click event of the cancel button.",
          "zh": "而那個事件處理函式是用在 cancel 按鈕的 click 事件上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 164.66,
          "end": 167.9,
          "en": "So the event target of that event is the cancel button,",
          "zh": "所以那個事件的 event.target 就是 cancel 按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 167.9,
          "end": 173.66,
          "en": "so we're using that HTML element to dispatch the event here and therefore the only place where we",
          "zh": "所以我們在這裡用那個 HTML 元素來派送事件，因此我們唯一能"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 173.66,
          "end": 177.09,
          "en": "can listen to that is that button.",
          "zh": "監聽它的地方就是那個按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 177.11,
          "end": 184.91,
          "en": "So if I would add an event listener here and I would listen for the cancel event here and there I just",
          "zh": "所以如果我在這裡加上 event listener，在這裡監聽 cancel 事件，然後我就"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 184.91,
          "end": 192.21,
          "en": "use an anonymous arrow function to quickly output cancel inside the component,",
          "zh": "用一個匿名的箭頭函式，快速在元件裡輸出 cancel，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 192.5,
          "end": 197.45,
          "en": "then we should see that log once we click the cancel button because now we're listening to the same",
          "zh": "那麼當我們點擊 cancel 按鈕時就應該會看到那個記錄，因為現在我們監聽的是"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 197.45,
          "end": 202.54,
          "en": "element where we dispatch this and indeed, here we see cancel inside the component.",
          "zh": "派送事件的那個相同元素，確實，這裡我們看到 cancel inside the component。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 202.55,
          "end": 205.89,
          "en": "So the good thing is dispatching our customer event works,",
          "zh": "所以好消息是，派送我們的 custom event 是可以運作的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 205.94,
          "end": 209.39,
          "en": "the bad thing is it is only available on our button,",
          "zh": "壞消息是，它只在我們的按鈕上可用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 209.48,
          "end": 213.06,
          "en": "it doesn't leave our component and that is not ideal.",
          "zh": "它不會離開我們的元件，而這並不理想。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 213.07999999999998,
          "end": 216.04,
          "en": "Let's work on that and I'll comment this out here,",
          "zh": "讓我們來處理這件事，我會把這裡註解掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 216.05,
          "end": 218.21,
          "en": "let's work on this in the next lecture.",
          "zh": "我們下一堂課再來處理。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "17206162",
      "title": "Configuring Custom Events",
      "lectureOrder": 612,
      "videoOrder": 538,
      "sourceHash": "bd7af79ac2115c76aee86d834b1134658bc01ba8d498ca447cc61e5dcc5c7fe3",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.14,
          "end": 8.08,
          "en": "So it would be really great if we could listen to our own event from outside our component and not just",
          "zh": "如果我們能從元件外部監聽自己的事件，而不只是"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.08,
          "end": 11.26,
          "en": "from inside because that kind of defeats its purpose, right?",
          "zh": "從內部監聽，那就太好了，因為後者有點失去意義，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 12.1,
          "end": 19.42,
          "en": "Well the good thing is when you create such an event, we can specify an object as a second argument where",
          "zh": "好消息是，當你建立這樣的事件時，我們可以指定一個物件作為第二個引數，在那裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 19.42,
          "end": 25.24,
          "en": "we can add some information about how this event should behave",
          "zh": "我們可以加入一些關於這個事件該如何運作的資訊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 25.24,
          "end": 29.21,
          "en": "and there, we basically got three configurations.",
          "zh": "而在那裡，我們基本上有三種設定。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 29.44,
          "end": 32.87,
          "en": "Bubbles allows us to define whatever this event should bubble up or not,",
          "zh": "bubbles 讓我們定義這個事件是否應該向上冒泡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 32.89,
          "end": 38.56,
          "en": "this means if it should only be available on the element we dispatched it on or if it is not handled",
          "zh": "這表示它應該只在我們派送它的元素上可用，或者如果在那裡沒有被處理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 38.56,
          "end": 39.12,
          "en": "there,",
          "zh": "就往上傳，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 39.19,
          "end": 42.66,
          "en": "if it should go to the next element in the DOM tree.",
          "zh": "它是否應該往 DOM 樹中的下一個元素傳遞。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 42.67,
          "end": 48.82,
          "en": "So in our case, for this button, the cancel button, if we don't add an event listener there, it would bubble",
          "zh": "所以在我們的例子裡，對這個按鈕也就是 cancel 按鈕，如果我們沒有在那裡加 event listener，它就會向上冒泡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 48.82,
          "end": 51.77,
          "en": "up and event listeners on the section would handle it",
          "zh": "然後 section 上的 event listener 會處理它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 51.88,
          "end": 57.1,
          "en": "and if we had no event listeners there, it would bubble up and event listeners on this div would handle",
          "zh": "而如果那裡沒有 event listener，它就會繼續向上冒泡，然後這個 div 上的 event listener 會處理"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 57.1,
          "end": 57.64,
          "en": "it",
          "zh": "它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 57.76,
          "end": 60.61,
          "en": "and if we have no listeners there, it would bubble up and so on.",
          "zh": "而如果那裡也沒有 listener，它就會繼續冒泡，依此類推。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 60.61,
          "end": 62.38,
          "en": "So this doesn't sound too bad, right?",
          "zh": "所以這聽起來還不錯，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 62.38,
          "end": 69.32,
          "en": "If I set this to true, let's see, now theoretically we should be able to listen to it from other places",
          "zh": "如果我把它設為 true，讓我們看看，現在理論上我們應該能從其他地方監聽它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 69.32,
          "end": 72.69,
          "en": "too and not just on event listeners on this button.",
          "zh": "而不只是在這個按鈕上的 event listener。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 72.74,
          "end": 79.15,
          "en": "So maybe now our event listener on our custom component, which in the end wraps this button, works.",
          "zh": "所以也許現在我們放在 custom component 上的 event listener 就能運作，那個元件最終包住了這個按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 79.34,
          "end": 84.61,
          "en": "So let's go back and reload and click cancel,",
          "zh": "所以讓我們回去、重新載入，然後點 cancel，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 84.61,
          "end": 86.22,
          "en": "still no output.",
          "zh": "還是沒有輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 86.35,
          "end": 91.99,
          "en": "The reason for that is that there is another important argument and that is the composed arguments here.",
          "zh": "原因是還有另一個重要的引數，也就是這裡的 composed 引數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 92.71000000000001,
          "end": 95.47999999999999,
          "en": "Composed when set to true",
          "zh": "把 composed 設為 true 時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 95.59,
          "end": 98.7,
          "en": "now suddenly ensures that this will work,",
          "zh": "現在突然就能確保它會運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 98.86,
          "end": 105.07,
          "en": "if I now click cancel, you see cancel here and the reason for that is that composed, which by default",
          "zh": "如果我現在點 cancel，你就會在這裡看到 cancel，原因是 composed——它預設"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 105.07,
          "end": 105.64,
          "en": "is false",
          "zh": "是 false，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 105.64,
          "end": 114.16,
          "en": "just like bubbles, composed means that if you set it to true, then this event may leave the shadow DOM",
          "zh": "就像 bubbles 一樣——composed 的意思是，如果你把它設為 true，這個事件就可以離開它所在的 shadow DOM，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 114.55,
          "end": 116.38,
          "en": "in which it is, if it is in one",
          "zh": "如果它確實在其中的話，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 116.5,
          "end": 119.78999999999999,
          "en": "and here of course, it is triggered inside of our shadow DOM.",
          "zh": "而在這裡，它當然是在我們的 shadow DOM 內部觸發的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 119.95,
          "end": 126.06,
          "en": "If you set composed to false, then the event must not leave our shadow DOM tree,",
          "zh": "如果你把 composed 設為 false，那麼這個事件就不能離開我們的 shadow DOM 樹，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 126.22,
          "end": 129.58,
          "en": "so it will bubble up but only inside our shadow DOM tree,",
          "zh": "所以它會向上冒泡，但只在我們的 shadow DOM 樹內部，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 129.67,
          "end": 134.77,
          "en": "so we could add a listener to modal and handle it but not outside of our component.",
          "zh": "所以我們可以為 modal 加上 listener 並處理它，但在元件外部就不行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 134.77,
          "end": 142.88,
          "en": "So we need to set both to true, bubbles and composed, to handle our event outside of our component",
          "zh": "所以我們需要把 bubbles 和 composed 都設為 true，才能在元件外部處理我們的事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 142.88,
          "end": 145.23,
          "en": "and now we can listen to it.",
          "zh": "現在我們就能監聽它了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 145.3,
          "end": 147.32999999999998,
          "en": "Now this is one way of doing that,",
          "zh": "這是一種做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 147.37,
          "end": 152.8,
          "en": "of course there is a simpler way too, I just show you this way because sometimes you need to take that",
          "zh": "當然也有更簡單的做法，我示範這個方式是因為有時候你就是得走"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 152.8,
          "end": 153.52,
          "en": "route,",
          "zh": "這條路，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 153.67000000000002,
          "end": 157.84,
          "en": "but of course for confirm and we could have done that for cancel too,",
          "zh": "但當然對 confirm——我們本來也可以對 cancel 這麼做——"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 157.84,
          "end": 162.13,
          "en": "we can also just refer to this, which is our component,",
          "zh": "我們也可以直接使用 this，也就是我們的元件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 162.13,
          "end": 168.73,
          "en": "so our own custom element in the end, remember our modal extends the HTML element,",
          "zh": "也就是我們自己的 custom element，記住，我們的 modal 繼承了 HTMLElement，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 168.76,
          "end": 176.29,
          "en": "so this really refers to our own custom HTML element in the end and therefore our custom element",
          "zh": "所以 this 最終真的指向我們自己的自訂 HTML 元素，因此我們的 custom element"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 176.29,
          "end": 180.11,
          "en": "itself also has the dispatch event method.",
          "zh": "本身也有 dispatchEvent 方法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 180.13,
          "end": 188.34,
          "en": "So here, our confirm event can also be holding a new event, here the confirm event,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我們的 confirmEvent 也可以裝著一個新事件，這裡就是 confirm 事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 188.35,
          "end": 192.58,
          "en": "so the name is confirm and you can pick any name you want but of course it should match the name we",
          "zh": "名稱是 confirm，你可以選任何你想要的名稱，但它當然應該和我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 192.58,
          "end": 198.12,
          "en": "are listening to outside and then here, I will use this confirm event and",
          "zh": "在外面監聽的名稱一致，然後在這裡，我會使用 this.confirmEvent，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 199.32999999999998,
          "end": 208.39,
          "en": "now if I save this without any extra config and I click okay, we still get confirmed because now",
          "zh": "現在如果我在沒有任何額外設定的情況下儲存，然後點 okay，我們仍然會得到 confirmed，因為現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 208.39,
          "end": 211.39,
          "en": "we're triggering this event on our element itself,",
          "zh": "我們是在元素本身觸發這個事件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 211.39,
          "end": 217.6,
          "en": "so not inside the shadow DOM, not on some nested element in the shadow DOM but on our custom element",
          "zh": "不是在 shadow DOM 裡面，不是在 shadow DOM 中某個巢狀元素上，而是在我們的 custom element"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 217.6,
          "end": 223.21,
          "en": "itself and therefore listeners on our element will of course receive that event.",
          "zh": "本身，因此我們元素上的 listener 當然會收到那個事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 223.21,
          "end": 225.55,
          "en": "It will not bubble up there now though,",
          "zh": "不過它在那裡不會向上冒泡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 225.55,
          "end": 230.38,
          "en": "so if we would want to listen to it on the body in our main document, this should not work",
          "zh": "所以如果我們想主要在文件裡的 body 上監聽它，這應該不會成功，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 230.38,
          "end": 238.11,
          "en": "but we also don't need to manage composed and so on because this is now simply not required.",
          "zh": "但我們也不需要處理 composed 之類的東西，因為現在根本不需要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 238.22,
          "end": 243,
          "en": "So this is of course the shorter alternative and the one you would typically use",
          "zh": "所以這當然是比較簡短的替代做法，也是你通常會用的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 243.17,
          "end": 249.53,
          "en": "but I found it important to mention how you can use bubbles and composed to also let events triggered",
          "zh": "但我覺得重要的是一定要提到，你可以如何使用 bubbles 和 composed，讓在 shadow DOM 內部某個巢狀元素上觸發的事件"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 249.53,
          "end": 256.55,
          "en": "inside your shadow DOM, on some nested element, bubbles up through the shadow DOM and potentially even",
          "zh": "向上冒泡穿過 shadow DOM，甚至可能"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 256.7,
          "end": 258.59,
          "en": "leave it with composed.",
          "zh": "透過 composed 離開它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 258.59,
          "end": 261.46,
          "en": "So these are the custom events and how we can handle it",
          "zh": "以上就是 custom event，以及我們如何處理它們，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 261.62,
          "end": 265.46,
          "en": "and now we have the full flexibility we might need,",
          "zh": "現在我們有了可能需要的完整彈性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 265.46,
          "end": 271.04,
          "en": "we're closing the modal and in our main application, which we typically would run or import in our main",
          "zh": "我們會關閉 modal，而在我們的主要應用程式裡——我們通常會主要文件"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 271.04,
          "end": 277.34000000000003,
          "en": "document, like this index.html file, there we can now also find out which button the user pressed",
          "zh": "中執行或匯入它，例如這個 index.html 檔——我們現在也能知道使用者按了哪個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 277.82,
          "end": 284.87,
          "en": "without having to kind of dig into our component and try to attach listeners to the buttons in the component",
          "zh": "而不需要深入我們的元件，也不需要試著把 listener 掛到元件裡的按鈕上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 284.87,
          "end": 286.03,
          "en": "from outside,",
          "zh": "也就是從外部去做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 286.1,
          "end": 290.65999999999997,
          "en": "instead we use these convenient listeners on our custom element itself.",
          "zh": "取而代之，我們在 custom element 本身上使用這些方便的 listener。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "17206166",
      "title": "Finishing it up!",
      "lectureOrder": 613,
      "videoOrder": 539,
      "sourceHash": "3bb80968f478c6960cfbb2d22a480b4f87c69ad9f9f32717d428dc2d1dc0f5d1",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.35,
          "end": 7.48,
          "en": "Now we added a lot of cool things to our, a little bit more complex component here,",
          "zh": "現在我們為這個稍微複雜一點的元件加了很多很酷的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.48,
          "end": 12.43,
          "en": "now let's wrap this all up by changing the styling a little bit, by making sure that we also can close",
          "zh": "現在讓我們來收尾，稍微改一下樣式，確保我們也能在點擊"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 12.43,
          "end": 14.31,
          "en": "the modal when we click the backdrop",
          "zh": "backdrop 時關閉 modal，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.47,
          "end": 21.64,
          "en": "and by also animating the modal a little bit when it comes in and goes away. Now definitely feel free",
          "zh": "並且在 modal 出現和消失時也稍微加上動畫。當然，你完全可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 21.64,
          "end": 26.3,
          "en": "to do some of these things on your own, pause the video, try it on your own at this point,",
          "zh": "自己先做做看這些事，暫停影片，在這個時候自己試試看，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 26.38,
          "end": 30.25,
          "en": "otherwise we'll do it together of course.",
          "zh": "不然的話，我們當然就一起來做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 30.25,
          "end": 31.87,
          "en": "So were you successful?",
          "zh": "那麼，你成功了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 32.56,
          "end": 33.46,
          "en": "Let's give this a try.",
          "zh": "讓我們來試試看。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 33.94,
          "end": 38.87,
          "en": "Let's start with a click listener on the backdrop which closes the modal.",
          "zh": "讓我們從 backdrop 上一個能關閉 modal 的 click listener 開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 38.91,
          "end": 42.81,
          "en": "Now this shouldn't be too hard right, in our modal component,",
          "zh": "這應該不會太難，對吧，在我們的 modal 元件裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 42.97,
          "end": 46.85,
          "en": "the backdrop in the end is this element with the ID backdrop,",
          "zh": "backdrop 說到底就是這個 ID 為 backdrop 的元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 47.23,
          "end": 51.79,
          "en": "so all we have to do is select it and then add an event listener.",
          "zh": "所以我們只要選取它，然後加上 event listener。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 51.79,
          "end": 62.61,
          "en": "So here I will select my backdrop with this shadow root query selector and then #backdrop because",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，我會用這個 shadow root 的 querySelector 加上 #backdrop 來選取我的 backdrop，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 62.64,
          "end": 68.95,
          "en": "again we have that ID backdrop on that div and now I just need to add an event listener and I'll",
          "zh": "那個 div 上確實有 ID backdrop，現在我只需要加上 event listener，我會"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 68.95,
          "end": 71.45,
          "en": "do that here next to my button event listeners,",
          "zh": "在我按鈕的 event listener 旁邊這裡做這件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 71.6,
          "end": 74.2,
          "en": "there I'll access this my backdrop",
          "zh": "在那裡我會存取 this.myBackdrop，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 74.2,
          "end": 80.41,
          "en": "and add an event listener, add this click listener of course and in the end here I want to do the same which",
          "zh": "然後加上 event listener，當然是加上這個 click listener，最後我想做的事和"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 80.41,
          "end": 86.47,
          "en": "I do when I click the cancel button because in the end, we cancel the modal when we click the backdrop.",
          "zh": "我點擊 cancel 按鈕時一樣，因為說到底，我們點 backdrop 就是要取消 modal。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 86.47,
          "end": 91.3,
          "en": "So I will use this cancel method here as an event handler, bind this,",
          "zh": "所以我會在這裡用 this.cancel 方法作為事件處理函式，綁定 this，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 91.48,
          "end": 95.67,
          "en": "so I will do exactly the same as I do for the cancel button.",
          "zh": "也就是我會做和 cancel 按鈕完全相同的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 95.88,
          "end": 97.84,
          "en": "And with this change, it should already work,",
          "zh": "有了這個變更，它應該就能運作了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 97.87,
          "end": 105.3,
          "en": "if I now go back, open this, click somewhere on the backdrop and it closes this, nice.",
          "zh": "如果我現在回去，開啟它，在 backdrop 上某處點一下，它就會關閉，太好了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 105.3,
          "end": 112.1,
          "en": "Now I want to work a little bit on the styling, I want to decrease the amount of whitespace we have up there,",
          "zh": "現在我想稍微處理一下樣式，我想減少上面那裡的空白，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 112.17,
          "end": 114.53999999999999,
          "en": "maybe add a line below our header.",
          "zh": "也許在我們的 header 下面加一條線。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 114.96000000000001,
          "end": 117.25,
          "en": "So for that I'll go into my styling here,",
          "zh": "為此我會進到這裡的樣式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 117.42,
          "end": 124.98,
          "en": "now for the line, I'll add a border bottom here on my header which wraps my header content in the",
          "zh": "現在為了那條線，我會在我的 header 上加上 border-bottom，那個 header 最終包住我的 header 內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 124.98,
          "end": 125.64,
          "en": "end",
          "zh": "最終，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 125.79,
          "end": 128.94,
          "en": "and that should be one pixel solid and #ccc.",
          "zh": "而它應該是 1 像素、solid 和 #ccc。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 128.97,
          "end": 130.43,
          "en": "So this is a light gray,",
          "zh": "這是淺灰色，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 130.47,
          "end": 132.84,
          "en": "it's the same light gray I have as a border top",
          "zh": "和我用在 actions 上的 border-top"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 132.84,
          "end": 142,
          "en": "on the actions and to reduce the amount of whitespace, for slotted h1 content which brings extra",
          "zh": "是同樣的淺灰色，而為了減少空白，對於會帶來額外"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 142,
          "end": 142.96,
          "en": "margins,",
          "zh": "邊界的 slotted h1 內容，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 142.96,
          "end": 152.21,
          "en": "I'll set the margins of that h1 tag to zero and now with that, if I reload, this looks much nicer.",
          "zh": "我會把那個 h1 標籤的 margin 設為 0，這樣一來，如果我重新載入，看起來就好多了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 152.24,
          "end": 158.9,
          "en": "So this is now the look I want to have, last but not least, let's add a tiny animation, a CSS transition",
          "zh": "這就是我現在想要的樣子，最後一項，讓我們加上一個小小的動畫，一個 CSS transition，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 158.9,
          "end": 160.26,
          "en": "to be precise",
          "zh": "更精確地說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 160.49,
          "end": 164.17000000000002,
          "en": "and for that, the modal itself should be animated when it comes in.",
          "zh": "而為此，modal 本身在出現時應該有動畫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 164.87,
          "end": 174.32999999999998,
          "en": "So to do that, I want to have it slide in from the top and go from opacity 0 to opacity 1 over let's",
          "zh": "所以要這麼做，我想讓它從頂部滑入，並在比如"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 174.32999999999998,
          "end": 183.57,
          "en": "say 300 milliseconds. So I'll actually reduce the top distance here to 10vh instead of 15 which I had before,",
          "zh": "300 毫秒內從 opacity 0 變成 opacity 1。所以我會把這裡的頂部距離從之前的 15 減少為 10vh，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 183.57,
          "end": 186.24,
          "en": "opacity already is set to 0 initially",
          "zh": "opacity 一開始已經設為 0，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 186.63,
          "end": 195.3,
          "en": "and then when we show it, which of course is the case here, I want to animate that. Now for that, I will",
          "zh": "然後當我們顯示它時——這裡當然就是這種情況——我想為它加上動畫。為此，我會"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 195.36,
          "end": 203.11,
          "en": "actually add an extra rule here for the",
          "zh": "在這裡為"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 203.16,
          "end": 209.73,
          "en": "opened state or my modal, where I also set top to 15vh,",
          "zh": "我的 modal 的 opened 狀態加上一條額外規則，在那裡我也把 top 設為 15vh，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 209.79,
          "end": 214.29,
          "en": "I can't do this in this combined rule because the backdrop should not be moved down.",
          "zh": "我不能在這個合併的規則裡這麼做，因為 backdrop 不應該被往下移。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 214.29,
          "end": 218.79,
          "en": "So here this is basically the end state, opacity 1 pointer events all",
          "zh": "所以在這裡，這基本上是結束狀態，opacity 1、pointer-events all，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 218.82,
          "end": 223.2,
          "en": "and then for the modal, also in addition, top set to 15vh,",
          "zh": "然後對 modal 來說，另外再加上 top 設為 15vh，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 223.2,
          "end": 229.56,
          "en": "so it is pushed down further than it is initially when it is invisible and now so that we can see that",
          "zh": "所以它被推到比一開始不可見時更低的位置，而現在為了讓我們能看到那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 229.56,
          "end": 230.4,
          "en": "change,",
          "zh": "變化，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 230.55,
          "end": 231,
          "en": "I'll add",
          "zh": "我會加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 231.01,
          "end": 236.69,
          "en": "the transition property to the modal and there I'll",
          "zh": "transition 屬性到 modal 上，在那裡我會"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 236.84,
          "end": 243.57,
          "en": "transition everything, so all properties should be watched and animated, over .3seconds with",
          "zh": "對所有東西做轉場，也就是所有屬性都應該被監看並加上動畫，時間是 0.3 秒，並使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 243.57,
          "end": 245.73,
          "en": "an ease out timing function",
          "zh": "ease-out 的時間函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 245.73,
          "end": 251.91,
          "en": "and if CSS transitions are something you're not familiar with, attached you find some helpful resources",
          "zh": "如果你對 CSS transition 不熟悉，附件裡有一些有幫助的資源，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 252.12,
          "end": 257.94,
          "en": "and my CSS - The complete Guide here on Udemy also of course is a great resource to learn more",
          "zh": "而我在 Udemy 上的 CSS - The Complete Guide 當然也是學習更多相關知識的"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 257.94,
          "end": 258.45,
          "en": "about that.",
          "zh": "絕佳資源。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 259.47,
          "end": 268.65,
          "en": "So now with that, if I reload this page, you'll see it slide in and also automatically slide out, the same",
          "zh": "這樣一來，如果我重新載入這個頁面，你就會看到它滑入，也會自動滑出，當我點擊這些按鈕"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 268.65,
          "end": 271.36,
          "en": "is the case when I click these buttons.",
          "zh": "時也是一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 271.38,
          "end": 275.89,
          "en": "So now we have this nice little animation here for our modal",
          "zh": "現在我們的 modal 有了這個不錯的小動畫，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 276,
          "end": 282.3,
          "en": "and with that, we built a pretty nice component which you can of course always enhance more, you can style",
          "zh": "如此一來，我們打造了一個相當不錯的元件，你當然隨時可以再強化它，你可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 282.3,
          "end": 287.90999999999997,
          "en": "these buttons differently, whatever you want but I'm very happy with that and I think we learned a lot",
          "zh": "用不同方式為這些按鈕設定樣式，隨你高興，但我對成果非常滿意，我認為我們在這個模組裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 287.90999999999997,
          "end": 289.2,
          "en": "of cool things in this module.",
          "zh": "學到了很多很酷的東西。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "34927684",
      "title": "Course Roundup",
      "lectureOrder": 615,
      "videoOrder": 540,
      "sourceHash": "2df4f752ac22cfee8b08f53d3827d65af8a39ae28112ae2be4da19bef595acee",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.15,
          "end": 2.318,
          "en": "Now. That's it for this course.",
          "zh": "那麼，這門課程就到這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.335,
          "end": 3.47,
          "en": "I hope you enjoyed it.",
          "zh": "希望你喜歡這門課。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 3.47,
          "end": 5.872,
          "en": "I hope you got a lot out of this course.",
          "zh": "希望你從這門課收穫良多。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.239,
          "end": 8.274,
          "en": "And I can only encourage you",
          "zh": "我只能鼓勵你"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 8.274,
          "end": 10.226,
          "en": "to keep on learning.",
          "zh": "繼續學習。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 10.226,
          "end": 11.31,
          "en": "Don't stop here!",
          "zh": "不要停在這裡！"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 11.31,
          "end": 13.496,
          "en": "Because taking a course is great",
          "zh": "因為上課很棒，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 13.579,
          "end": 15.231,
          "en": "- and I got more courses",
          "zh": "——我還有更多課程，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 15.231,
          "end": 16.732,
          "en": "if you want to dive deeper -",
          "zh": "如果你想更深入——"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 16.732,
          "end": 18.901,
          "en": "but if you want to master something,",
          "zh": "但如果你想精通某件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 18.901,
          "end": 19.518,
          "en": "if you want to get",
          "zh": "如果你想讓自己"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 19.518,
          "end": 21.687,
          "en": "really good at something,",
          "zh": "真的很擅長某件事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 21.687,
          "end": 24.106,
          "en": "you have to apply what you learned.",
          "zh": "你必須應用你所學到的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 24.123,
          "end": 25.524,
          "en": "You have to use it.",
          "zh": "你必須去使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 25.524,
          "end": 28.043,
          "en": "Use it in your day to day projects.",
          "zh": "在你每天的專案裡使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 28.26,
          "end": 29.895,
          "en": "Build demo projects",
          "zh": "建立示範專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 29.895,
          "end": 31.947,
          "en": "where you apply what you learned.",
          "zh": "在裡面應用你所學到的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 32.214,
          "end": 34.216,
          "en": "Make sure that you don't lose",
          "zh": "確保你不會失去"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 34.216,
          "end": 35.25,
          "en": "that knowledge",
          "zh": "那些知識，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 35.25,
          "end": 37.102,
          "en": "because taking a course",
          "zh": "因為上課"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 37.102,
          "end": 39.137,
          "en": "gives you that solid foundation,",
          "zh": "會給你穩固的基礎，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 39.137,
          "end": 41.873,
          "en": "but you only become good at something",
          "zh": "但你唯有"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 42.023,
          "end": 44.025,
          "en": "if you then use that foundation",
          "zh": "接著運用那個基礎，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 44.025,
          "end": 44.693,
          "en": "to use it",
          "zh": "去使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 44.693,
          "end": 46.111,
          "en": "in your day to day work,",
          "zh": "在你每天的工作中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 46.111,
          "end": 48.446,
          "en": "in your everyday work, in your projects.",
          "zh": "在你日常的工作裡，在你的專案中，才會變得擅長某件事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 48.78,
          "end": 49.698,
          "en": "And therefore, I would",
          "zh": "因此，我"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 49.698,
          "end": 50.098,
          "en": "of course",
          "zh": "當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 50.098,
          "end": 52.217,
          "en": "love to see you in other courses.",
          "zh": "會很期待在其他課程見到你。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 52.217,
          "end": 53.601,
          "en": "But either way, I wish you",
          "zh": "不過無論如何，我祝你"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 53.601,
          "end": 55.386,
          "en": "all the best for your future.",
          "zh": "未來一切順利。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
